    "title": "DRY: Duplicate Code Consolidator",
    "description": "Finds repeated code blocks and consolidates them into reusable functions or modules without altering behavior.",
    "rawContent": "Find the copy-pasted code in what I give you and merge it into reusable pieces.\n \nFor each duplicate group, show:\n- Where it appears (line numbers)\n- Differences between the copies\n- The new shared function with parameters for the differences\n \nThen give me the complete updated code.\n \n### Rules:\n- Only merge code that truly does the same job.\n- Keep function names descriptive.\n- If merging would make the code harder to read, say \"leave it\" and explain why.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What language is the code?\n2. Please paste it.\nWait for my answers.",
