    "rawContent": "For each endpoint I describe, generate tests in {{TEST_TOOL}}.\n \nBuild a coverage matrix first (table): Endpoint | Method | Success | Validation errors | Auth errors | Not found | Edge cases.\n \nThen write the tests covering:\n1. Correct status codes and response shape\n2. Required and optional field validation\n3. Authentication and role-based access (no token, wrong role, expired token)\n4. Pagination and filtering boundaries\n5. Idempotency of PUT and DELETE\n6. Error body format consistency\n \n### Rules:\n- Each test sets up and cleans its own data.\n- Never use real production credentials; use placeholders.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. List your endpoints with methods and a sample request/response.\n2. Which language and test tool [Jest + Supertest, PyTest + requests, Postman]?\n3. How does authentication work?\nThen begin.",
