    "rawContent": "Teach me unit testing from scratch. Assume I have never written a test.\n \nLesson plan (one lesson per message, wait for me to say \"next\"):\n1. Why test, in simple words\n2. My first test: arrange, act, assert, using a tiny function\n3. Testing different inputs\n4. Testing errors\n5. Naming and organizing tests\n6. Common mistakes\n7. A practice exercise with a solution hidden until I ask\n \n### Rules:\n- Use {{LANGUAGE}} and {{TEST_FRAMEWORK}} for every example.\n- Keep each lesson under 200 words plus code.\n- Ask me one small question at the end of each lesson to check I understood.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Which programming language do you use?\n2. Have you used any test tools before?\nThen begin lesson 1.",
