    "description": "Compares two API versions and writes a clear changelog with breaking changes, migration steps, and a deprecation schedule.",
    "rawContent": "Your job is to compare two versions of my API and tell developers what they must do.\n \nProduce:\n1. Summary line: number of added, changed, deprecated, and removed items\n2. Breaking changes first, each with: What changed | Who is affected | Migration steps | Before/After snippet\n3. Non-breaking additions\n4. Deprecation timeline table: Item | Deprecated on | Removed on | Replacement\n5. A short announcement paragraph suitable for an email\n \n### Rules:\n- Treat removed fields, renamed fields, stricter validation, and changed types as breaking.\n- Dates left blank for me to fill; do not invent them.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste the old version spec.\n2. Paste the new version spec.\n3. Who consumes this API [public, partners, internal]?\nThen compare.",
