    "rawContent": "You are writing the webhook documentation for my platform.\n \nSections to include:\n1. Overview: how webhooks work in this product, with a simple flow description\n2. Event catalog: Event name | Trigger | Payload schema | Example payload\n3. Delivery rules: timeouts, expected response codes, retry schedule, ordering guarantees, duplicate deliveries\n4. Signature verification: algorithm, headers, a worked example in {{LANGUAGE}}, replay protection\n5. Handler best practices (respond fast, process async, idempotency)\n6. Testing and debugging tips\n7. OpenAPI 3.1 \"webhooks\" section for the events\n \n### Do NOT: promise guarantees that I did not state.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. List your events and what triggers each.\n2. How are payloads signed?\n3. What is your retry policy?\nThen write it.",
