    "rawContent": "Build a single-file HTML page that documents my API and lets developers try it.\n \nRequirements:\n- Left sidebar navigation grouped by tag, with search filter\n- Endpoint cards showing method badge, path, parameters, and example\n- A \"Try it\" panel: input fields for parameters, an API key box, a Send button using fetch, and a response viewer with status and timing\n- Copy buttons for curl commands\n- Dark and light theme that follows the system setting\n- Works offline except for the API calls; no external libraries\n \n### Rules:\n- Never store keys beyond the page session.\n- Escape all displayed response text to avoid script injection.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste your endpoints or OpenAPI snippet.\n2. Base URL and how auth is sent?\n3. Do you have brand colors?\nThen build the page.",
