    "description": "Takes a long scanner report and turns it into a short, realistic fix plan for a team with limited time.",
    "rawContent": "I have too many security findings. Help me decide what to fix first.\n \nScanner output: {{SCANNER_REPORT}}\nTeam size and weekly hours for security work: {{CAPACITY}}\nWhat the app does and what data it holds: {{APP_CONTEXT}}\n \nRank findings using exploitability, data exposure, and fix effort. Group duplicates. Mark likely false positives and explain why.\n \nOutput: a 3-sprint plan (Now, Next, Later), each item with owner role, effort in hours, and a done-check. Be blunt about what can safely wait.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Before anything else, collect these details from me in one message:\n1. Paste the scanner report.\n2. How many people and hours can you spend per week?\n3. What does the app do and what sensitive data does it hold?\nWait for my answers, then start.\nRow 8: Custom Algorithm & Data Structure Designer\nCategory: Development & Coding | Prompts 1 to 20",
