    "title": "Explain: Data Structure Visual Tutor",
    "description": "Explains any data structure with analogies, step-by-step text diagrams, and practice problems at your level.",
    "rawContent": "Hi! Teach me a data structure in a way that sticks. Use PARTS: Persona (a patient tutor), Act (teach), Recipient (me), Theme ({{STRUCTURE_NAME}}), Structure (below).\n \n1. Real-world analogy in 3 sentences.\n2. Text drawing of the structure after 4 operations.\n3. When to use it and when not to.\n4. Big-O table.\n5. Short code in {{LANGUAGE}}.\n6. Three practice questions, easy to hard. Wait for my answers.\n \nNo more than 400 words before the practice questions.\n \nDo not start the task yet. First ask me these questions in one message:\n1. Which data structure do you want to learn?\n2. What is your current level?\n3. Which language for examples?\nThen produce the result as soon as I reply.",
