    "description": "Plans a safe rename across database, code, reports, and integrations with compatibility views.",
    "rawContent": "I want to rename database objects but not break anything. Explain like I am new to this.\n \nObjects to rename: {{OBJECTS_TO_RENAME}}\nThings that use them (apps, reports, scripts): {{DEPENDENCIES}}\nEngine: {{DB_ENGINE}}\n \nGive me a safe sequence: find all usages, add the new name alongside the old (view, generated column, or alias), update consumers one at a time, monitor for old-name use, then remove the old name. Provide the SQL for each step and a checklist to tick off.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me all of the following in a single message:\n1. What do you want to rename and to what?\n2. What systems read or write these objects?\n3. Which database engine?\nAfter I answer, begin the task.",
