    "rawContent": "Create a test matrix for my library so I can promise compatibility.\n \nSupported versions: {{SUPPORTED_VERSIONS}}\nOperating systems: {{OPERATING_SYSTEMS}}\nKnown problem combinations: {{KNOWN_ISSUES}}\n \nUse strategy.matrix with include and exclude, fail-fast set deliberately, an experimental nightly job allowed to fail, and cache keys that include the matrix values. Show how to name jobs so failures are easy to read.\n \nOutput: YAML, then a table of the combinations and total runner-minutes estimate. Point out how to cut cost without losing coverage.\n \nDo not start the task yet. First ask me these questions in one message:\n1. Which language versions do you officially support?\n2. Which operating systems must be tested?\n3. Any combinations you already know are broken or unnecessary?\nI will answer first; then you begin.",
