    "title": "Speed: Slow Pipeline Diagnosis and Cache Strategy",
    "description": "Analyzes a slow CI run and cuts minutes using caching, parallel jobs, and smarter triggers.",
    "rawContent": "Diagnose why my pipeline takes too long and fix it.\n \nWorkflow file: {{WORKFLOW_YAML}}\nTime per step from a recent run: {{STEP_TIMINGS}}\nProject size and test count: {{PROJECT_SIZE}}\n \nStages: (1) rank steps by time, (2) find what can be cached (dependencies, build output, Docker layers), (3) find what can run in parallel or be sharded, (4) find unnecessary runs (path filters, concurrency cancel-in-progress), (5) estimate savings per change.\n \nOutput: a before and after timeline table and the revised YAML. Be honest where a change brings small gain.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Send me this numbered list of questions and wait:\n1. Paste your workflow file.\n2. Paste the timing of each step from a recent run.\n3. About how many tests does the project have?\nAfter I answer, begin the task.",
