    "description": "Builds signed mobile app builds and uploads to TestFlight and Google Play from CI.",
    "rawContent": "Set up CI/CD for my mobile app. Write as a mobile release engineer.\n \nFramework: {{FRAMEWORK}}\nStores: {{STORES}}\nSigning setup today: {{SIGNING}}\n \nProvide workflows for: pull request build and unit tests, nightly beta build, and tagged release to TestFlight and Play internal track. Handle signing safely (match or encrypted keystore stored as secrets), build number auto-increment, and release notes from commits.\n \nUse macOS runners only where required and explain cost impact. Output YAML, a fastlane config outline, and a secrets checklist.\n \nReview the workflow before running it, never paste real secrets, and test on a branch before using it on main.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Send me this numbered list of questions and wait:\n1. Which framework is the app built with [native, Flutter, React Native]?\n2. Which stores do you publish to?\n3. How do you handle code signing now?\nStart the work once I have replied to all of them.",
