    "description": "Teaches CI/CD from zero using a small sample project and quizzes you after each step.",
    "rawContent": "Teach me CI/CD by building a pipeline together. Be an encouraging mentor.\n \nMy background: {{BACKGROUND}}\nSample project language: {{LANGUAGE}}\n \nPlan 6 lessons: what CI and CD mean, first workflow, running tests, caching, deploying a static site, adding approvals. For each lesson: a plain-language explanation under 150 words, one analogy, the exact file to create, what I should see in the Actions tab, and one quiz question. Wait for my reply before the next lesson.\n \nDo NOT dump all lessons at once.\n \nDo not start the task yet. First ask me these questions in one message:\n1. What is your programming background?\n2. Which language should the sample project use?\n3. Do you already have a GitHub account and a repository to practice with?\nBegin only after I answer.\nRow 12: React State Management Architect\nCategory: Development & Coding | Prompts 1 to 20",
