    "title": "State: Choose Between Redux, Zustand and Context",
    "description": "Compares state tools against your app's size, team, and data flow and recommends one with reasons.",
    "rawContent": "You are a senior React architect advising a team that has not chosen a state tool yet.\n \n### Context\n- App description: {{APP_DESCRIPTION}}\n- Team size and React experience: {{TEAM_EXPERIENCE}}\n- Data that is shared across screens: {{SHARED_DATA}}\n \n### Task\nCompare Redux Toolkit, Zustand, Jotai, Context with useReducer, and server-state tools like TanStack Query for MY app. Do not recommend one tool for everything.\n \n### Output\n1. Comparison table (Tool | Fit for my app | Boilerplate | Learning curve | Risk)\n2. Final recommendation in 5 sentences\n3. What would make you change the recommendation\n \n### Do NOT\n- Recommend Redux by default\n \nDo not start the task yet. Interview me first with these questions, all in one message:\n1. Describe your app and its main screens.\n2. How big is the team and how experienced with React?\n3. What data must be shared between distant parts of the app?\nWait for my answers, then start.",
