    "rawContent": "Act as a React performance engineer. Find why my UI re-renders too much.\n \nSlow component code: {{COMPONENT_CODE}}\nState management code: {{STORE_CODE}}\nProfiler observations: {{PROFILER_NOTES}}\n \nWork in order: (1) trace what triggers each render, (2) identify new object or array identities created each render, (3) check context value changes, (4) check store selectors returning new references, (5) suggest fixes ranked by gain: split context, selectors, memo, state colocation, virtualization.\n \nDo NOT recommend useMemo everywhere; justify each use. Output: findings table and patched code.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me all of the following in a single message:\n1. Paste the slow components.\n2. Paste how the state is stored and read.\n3. What did the React Profiler show, if you used it?\nStart the work once I have replied to all of them.",
