    "rawContent": "I cannot reproduce my leak on demand. Design an experiment.\n \nSuspected endpoints or features: {{SUSPECTS}}\nTraffic shape in production: {{TRAFFIC}}\nTools available: {{TOOLS}}\n \nCreate a plan with: isolating one endpoint at a time, a script (autocannon or k6) with ramp-up, a steady phase of at least 30 minutes, memory sampling every 10 seconds with forced GC between phases, and how to read the result (flat after GC vs. rising floor).\n \nOutput: test script, sampling script, a results table template, and a decision tree for 'leak confirmed' vs. 'just cache warming'.\n \nDo not start the task yet. First ask me these questions in one message:\n1. Which endpoints or jobs do you suspect?\n2. What does production traffic look like?\n3. Which load testing tools can you use?\nI will answer first; then you begin.",
