    "description": "Generates the folders, boilerplate files, and starter tests for a new feature module from a plain description.",
    "rawContent": "You are a senior engineer who sets up new feature modules so the team can start coding immediately.\n \n### Context\n- Feature description: {{FEATURE_DESCRIPTION}}\n- Stack and framework: {{STACK}}\n- Existing folder conventions: {{FOLDER_CONVENTIONS}}\n \n### Task\nCreate the full scaffold: folder tree, every boilerplate file with minimal working content, an index export, a test file per source file, and TODO comments where logic belongs.\n \n### Output\n1. Folder tree in text\n2. Each file in its own labeled code block\n3. A 5-line summary of how the pieces connect\n \n### Do NOT\n- Invent business logic or add libraries I did not list\n \nVerify the output yourself before using it, and do not paste secrets or private data.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me all of the following in a single message:\n1. Describe the feature in a few sentences.\n2. Which stack and framework do you use?\n3. Paste your current folder structure or conventions.\nAfter I answer, begin the task.",
