    "rawContent": "You are a developer-experience engineer. Build a scaffolding generator for my team.\n \nTypes of things we create repeatedly: {{REPEATED_THINGS}}\nProject conventions: {{CONVENTIONS}}\nTooling available: {{TOOLING}}\n \nChoose between Plop, Hygen, Yeoman, cookiecutter, or a custom script and justify briefly. Then provide: generator configuration, prompts for the user (name, options), template files with placeholders and case helpers (PascalCase, kebab-case), automatic insertion into index or route files, and a command to run it.\n \nOutput the folder structure, templates, and a sample run with the files created.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me all of the following in a single message:\n1. What kinds of files or modules do you create most often?\n2. Describe your project conventions or paste an example.\n3. Which tools and languages does the team use?\nOnly begin once every question above is answered.",
