    "rawContent": "Reshape my messy module into a clean structure. Do it safely.\n \nCurrent folder tree and key files: {{CURRENT_TREE}}\nProblems I feel: {{PAIN_POINTS}}\nTarget architecture style: {{TARGET_STYLE}}\n \nStages: (1) describe the responsibilities you see mixed together, (2) propose the target tree with a purpose line per folder, (3) map each current file to its new location in a table, (4) list import changes, (5) provide a git mv script and an order of moves in small safe commits, (6) add rules to stop it decaying (lint boundaries).\n \nDo NOT change behavior.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Interview me first with these questions, all in one message:\n1. Paste the current folder tree.\n2. What bothers you about it?\n3. Which structure do you want [feature folders, layers, hexagonal]?\nBegin only after I answer.",
