    "title": "Description: Pull Request Description Improver",
    "description": "Rewrites a thin PR description into a clear summary with context, risk, and test notes for reviewers.",
    "rawContent": "Can you rewrite my pull request description so reviewers instantly understand it?\n \nMy current description: {{CURRENT_DESCRIPTION}}\nDiff summary or changed files: {{CHANGED_FILES}}\nRelated ticket: {{TICKET}}\n \nUse this layout: What and why (2 to 3 sentences), How it works (bullets), How I tested it, Risks and rollback, Screenshots or output placeholders, and 'Where reviewers should look closely'.\n \nKeep it under 250 words. Do not claim tests that I did not mention.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Before anything else, collect these details from me in one message:\n1. Paste your current PR description.\n2. List the main files or areas changed.\n3. Is there a ticket or issue link and what testing did you do?\nWait for my answers, then start.",
