    "description": "Reviews names, function size, comments, and structure so the next reader understands the code in minutes.",
    "rawContent": "Review this code for readability like a patient but honest reviewer. The next developer will read it at 5 p.m. on a Friday.\n \nCode: {{CODE}}\nLanguage: {{LANGUAGE}}\n \nGive feedback on: unclear names, functions doing more than one thing, deep nesting, magic numbers, misleading or outdated comments, boolean flags that hide meaning, and inconsistent patterns.\n \nOutput: top 7 issues each with the line, why it hurts, and a rewrite of just that part. Rate overall readability from 1 to 5 with one sentence. Skip anything a linter would catch.\n \nDo not start the task yet. I will need the answers to these first, so ask them together:\n1. Paste the code.\n2. Which language is it?\n3. Who maintains this code [beginners, experts, mixed]?\nOnly begin once every question above is answered.",
