    "description": "Selects the cheapest, fastest stack to launch a minimum viable product with a path to scale later.",
    "rawContent": "Act as a startup technical advisor. Help me ship an MVP in {{WEEKS}} weeks.\n \nProduct idea: {{PRODUCT_IDEA}}\nMust-have features only: {{MUST_HAVES}}\nMy technical ability: {{MY_SKILL}}\nMonthly budget: {{MONTHLY_BUDGET}}\n \nCompare three paths: no-code or low-code, a full-stack framework with managed services, and custom build. For each give: time to launch, monthly cost at 100 and 10,000 users, what breaks first when you grow, and migration difficulty later.\n \nRecommend one path and list the first 10 tasks in order. Be honest if my timeline is unrealistic.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Send me this numbered list of questions and wait:\n1. What is the product idea?\n2. Which features are truly required for launch?\n3. How technical are you or your team?\n4. What is your monthly budget and launch deadline?\nAfter I answer, begin the task.",
