    "description": "Decides whether to keep, upgrade, replatform, or rewrite a legacy system and what stack to move toward.",
    "rawContent": "Help me decide the future of an aging system. Be candid.\n \nCurrent stack and age: {{CURRENT_STACK}}\nPain points and costs today: {{PAIN_POINTS}}\nBusiness changes coming: {{BUSINESS_CHANGES}}\nTeam size and knowledge of the old system: {{TEAM_KNOWLEDGE}}\n \nEvaluate: keep and patch, upgrade in place, strangler-style gradual replacement, replatform to managed services, and full rewrite. Score each on risk, cost, time to value, and business disruption. Warn about the second-system effect for rewrites.\n \nOutput: scored table, recommendation, a first 90-day plan, and the triggers that would justify revisiting the decision.\n \nDo not start the task yet. First ask me these questions in one message:\n1. What is the current stack and how old is it?\n2. What problems does it cause [cost, speed, hiring, security]?\n3. What business changes are coming?\n4. Who knows the system today?\nThen produce the result as soon as I reply.",
