    "id": "f02d75de-9593-5e22-b395-79db1ddf1be9",
    "title": "Performance: Backdrop Filter Cost and Optimization",
    "description": "Explains how blur affects GPU and battery and optimizes glass effects for low-end devices.",
    "rawContent": "My glass effects make scrolling janky on phones. Diagnose and fix.\n \nCSS and page structure: {{CSS_STRUCTURE}}\nDevices where it is slow: {{DEVICES}}\n \nExplain what backdrop-filter costs, then review: number and size of blurred layers, blur radius, animating blurred elements, large overlapping areas, and use of will-change. Offer fixes: smaller blur values, fewer layers, static pseudo-element blur, @media rules for reduced capability, and prefers-reduced-transparency where available.\n \nOutput: ranked list of fixes with CSS and how to profile with DevTools.\n \nDo not start the task yet. I will need the answers to these first, so ask them together:\n1. Paste the CSS and describe the page structure.\n2. Which devices are slow?\nAfter I answer, begin the task.",
