    "rawContent": "You are a design systems engineer. Create a compact glass component kit.\n \nComponents needed: {{COMPONENTS}}\nStack: {{STACK}}\nSupported themes: {{THEMES}}\n \nDefine tokens (blur levels: subtle, medium, strong; opacity levels; radius; border; shadow elevation), then components: surface, card, button, input, modal, navbar, and badge, each with size and variant modifiers. Document usage rules: where glass is allowed and forbidden, and max nesting depth.\n \nOutput: token file, component CSS, a usage guide in table form, and a sample page.\n \nDo not start the task yet. I will need the answers to these first, so ask them together:\n1. Which components do you need?\n2. What stack do you use [plain CSS, React, Vue, Tailwind]?\n3. Which themes must be supported?\nStart the work once I have replied to all of them.",
