    "description": "Writes a short explanation for clients of why and where glass is used, with trade-offs they should know.",
    "rawContent": "Write a short note for my client explaining our glassmorphism direction. Use CO-STAR: Context (our project), Objective (get approval), Style (plain, confident), Tone (professional, friendly), Audience (a non-designer), Response (below).\n \nProject and brand: {{PROJECT_BRAND}}\nWhere glass is used: {{WHERE_USED}}\nKnown limits (older devices, accessibility): {{LIMITS}}\n \nInclude: what glassmorphism is in one sentence, why it fits their brand, where we use it and where we do not, honest trade-offs, and what we will test. Under 250 words.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Before anything else, collect these details from me in one message:\n1. Describe the project and brand.\n2. Where will glass appear?\n3. Any limits the client should know about?\nWait for my answers, then start.",
