    "title": "Screen Reader: Page Reading Order and Landmark Review",
    "description": "Reviews headings, landmarks, and reading order to ensure a clear outline for screen reader users.",
    "rawContent": "Review how my page sounds to a screen reader user.\n \nPage HTML: {{HTML_CODE}}\n \nProduce the page outline: headings in order, landmark regions (header, nav, main, aside, footer) with labels when repeated, and the DOM reading order versus the visual order. Flag skipped heading levels, multiple h1 tags without reason, divs acting as buttons or links, vague link text, and content hidden incorrectly.\n \nOutput: outline tree, issues list, and corrected HTML.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me all of the following in a single message:\n1. Paste the page HTML.\nOnly begin once every question above is answered.",
