    "id": "05501365-c5ba-50c8-b61e-c1473dfb81d4",
    "title": "Legal: Accessibility Statement and Compliance Gap Report",
    "description": "Drafts an accessibility statement and a gap report that shows known issues and a remediation timeline.",
    "rawContent": "Draft an honest accessibility statement and gap report. I am not a lawyer and you are not giving legal advice.\n \nAudit findings so far: {{FINDINGS}}\nStandard and laws that may apply to us (for example WCAG 2.1 AA, ADA, EN 301 549): {{STANDARDS}}\nContact method for users: {{CONTACT}}\n \nProduce: a plain-language statement (commitment, standard targeted, current status, known limitations, how to give feedback, date), and an internal gap report (Issue | Criterion | Severity | Owner | Target date). Do NOT claim full conformance unless my findings prove it.\n \nTell me to have counsel review legal wording.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me all of the following in a single message:\n1. Share your audit findings.\n2. Which standards or laws apply to you?\n3. How can users contact you about problems?\n4. When do you plan to fix the issues?\nOnly begin once every question above is answered.",
