    "description": "Builds a short team workshop with exercises, demos, and a quiz on the most common issues.",
    "rawContent": "Plan a {{DURATION}} accessibility workshop for my team.\n \nTeam roles and experience: {{TEAM}}\nTech stack: {{STACK}}\n \nCreate an agenda with timings, three live demos (keyboard-only use, screen reader on a bad page, contrast check), four hands-on exercises with broken code to fix, discussion questions, a 10-question quiz with answers, and a take-home checklist.\n \nOutput: agenda table, exercise code, quiz, and checklist.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me all of the following in a single message:\n1. Who is on the team and what is their experience?\n2. What stack do they use?\n3. How long is the session?\n4. Will it be in person or remote?\nAfter I answer, begin the task.",
