    "rawContent": "Turn my wireframe into a handoff brief. Use CO-STAR: Context (the landing page project), Objective (let a designer and developer build without guessing), Style (precise and scannable), Tone (neutral), Audience (designer and front-end developer), Response (below).\n \nWireframe HTML: {{WIREFRAME}}\nBrand assets and constraints: {{BRAND_CONSTRAINTS}}\n \nSections: goal and primary metric, section-by-section requirements (content, behavior, states), responsive rules, tracking events to fire, accessibility requirements, performance budget, and open questions.\n \nOutput the brief in a table-friendly layout.\n \nDo not start the task yet. I will need the answers to these first, so ask them together:\n1. Paste the wireframe.\n2. What brand rules or technical limits apply?\n3. Which analytics events matter [CTA click, form submit]?\nOnly begin once every question above is answered.",
