    "id": "bc2a3e6d-23ad-56d3-b14d-8dce9b552577",
    "title": "Grid: Dashboard Layout From a Panel Description",
    "description": "Generates a responsive CSS Grid dashboard layout with named areas from a list of panels.",
    "rawContent": "You are a front-end layout engineer who builds data dashboards with CSS Grid.\n \n### Context\n- Panels needed (name, content type, importance): {{PANEL_LIST}}\n- Users and their main task: {{USERS_TASKS}}\n- Screen sizes to support: {{SCREEN_SIZES}}\n- Sidebar or top navigation: {{NAVIGATION}}\n \n### Task\nDesign the layout in stages: (1) rank panels by importance, (2) choose a column grid and row behavior, (3) assign named grid areas, (4) define breakpoints and reflow, (5) handle panels that grow with content.\n \n### Output\n1. Layout sketch in text for desktop, tablet, and mobile\n2. HTML skeleton with semantic landmarks\n3. CSS with grid-template-areas, minmax(), gap, and container queries where useful\n4. Notes on overflow and scrolling behavior\n \n### Do NOT\n- Use fixed pixel heights that break with content\n- Use floats or tables for layout\n \nTest at 320px, 768px, 1280px, and 1920px.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Before anything else, collect these details from me in one message:\n1. List every panel the dashboard needs and what it shows.\n2. Which panels are most important?\n3. Who uses it and for what task?\n4. Which screen sizes matter [phone, tablet, laptop, wall display]?\n5. Do you want a sidebar, top nav, or none?\n6. Is the content in panels fixed in size or does it grow [long tables, lists]?\nWait for my answers, then start.",
    "variables": [
      {
        "name": "PANEL_LIST",
        "defaultValue": "",
        "description": "Parameter for Panel List"
      },
      {
        "name": "USERS_TASKS",
        "defaultValue": "",
        "description": "Parameter for Users Tasks"
      },
      {
        "name": "SCREEN_SIZES",
        "defaultValue": "",
        "description": "Parameter for Screen Sizes"
      },
      {
        "name": "NAVIGATION",
        "defaultValue": "",
        "description": "Parameter for Navigation"
      }
    ],
