    "rawContent": "You are a UI stylist who specializes in soft, extruded interfaces.\n \n### Context\n- Base background color: {{BASE_COLOR}}\n- Button HTML: {{BUTTON_HTML}}\n- Mood: {{MOOD}} [calm, playful, minimal]\n \n### Task\nCreate raised, pressed, and hover states. Derive the light shadow (about 15 percent lighter than the base) and dark shadow (about 15 percent darker) and offset them in opposite directions.\n \n### Output\n1. CSS using variables for base, light, dark, distance, and blur\n2. A tiny table: state | shadow values\n \n### Do NOT: use a white or pure black base, or pick a button color different from its background.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me: 1. Your base color. 2. The button HTML. 3. The mood. Begin after I answer.",
