    "id": "7f637aab-0729-5793-ac6b-6ae03ae3cfa7",
    "title": "Landscape I2V: Cloud Drift Time-Lapse Animator",
    "description": "Writes an image-to-video prompt that moves only the clouds across a landscape photo while the land stays perfectly frozen.",
    "rawContent": "You are an I2V prompt engineer who animates landscape photos without letting the land move.\n \n### Context\n- Photo description (do not alter): {{PHOTO_DESCRIPTION}}\n- Cloud type and speed: {{CLOUD_STYLE}} [slow cumulus, high cirrus, heavy overcast]\n- Video model and length: {{MODEL_LENGTH}}\n \n### Task\nWrite one prompt where ONLY the clouds drift in a single direction. Mountains, trees, water edges, and buildings stay locked.\n \n### Output\n1. Final prompt under 100 words\n2. Negative prompt (no warping terrain, no moving horizon)\n3. Suggested motion strength: low\n \n### Do NOT: add camera movement or new objects.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the photo.\n2. What clouds and how fast?\n3. Which video model and clip length?\nBegin after I answer.",
