    "rawContent": "I want soft falling snow in my winter photo. Keep it peaceful and keep everything else still.\n \nPlease write:\n1. A main prompt describing snowflake size, speed, and drift direction (slow, wind from the left)\n2. A \"locked elements\" sentence naming the trees, cabin, and ground\n3. A negative prompt that blocks snow piling up, ground changing, and sudden blizzards\n4. A tip about foreground vs background flakes (bigger and blurrier in front)\n \n### Rules: Under 100 words for the main prompt. Calm tone words only.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What is in the photo?\n2. Day, dusk, or night?\n3. Which video model and clip length?\nThen begin.",
