    "description": "Animates waterfalls and cascades with convincing flowing water, mist at the base, and fixed rocks and cliffs.",
    "rawContent": "Write an I2V prompt that makes a waterfall flow convincingly.\n \nCover these elements, one sentence each:\n- Water: falling direction, streaming texture, and speed (fast vertical streaks)\n- Impact zone: splash and rising mist, softly animated\n- River below: downstream flow direction\n- Rocks and cliffs: completely locked, no moving stones\n- Vegetation: tiny movement only from spray\n \nThen add a loop note: how to make the first and last frames match for an endless loop.\n \n### Output\nPrompt under 130 words, negative prompt, loop tip.\n \n### Do NOT: change the waterfall width or add extra falls.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the waterfall photo.\n2. Do you need a seamless loop?\n3. Model and length?\nThen write.",
