    "description": "Animates sea waves, foam, and wet sand while keeping cliffs, horizon line, and rocks fixed.",
    "rawContent": "Make the sea in my beach photo come alive while the shore and horizon stay put.\n \nDescribe in the prompt:\n1. Wave behavior: roll in, break, foam spread, retreat (one sequence only)\n2. Horizon: perfectly straight and unmoving\n3. Sand: wet sheen appearing and fading as water retreats\n4. Rocks and cliffs: locked\n5. Sky: still, or very slow clouds\n \n### Rules:\n- Waves must travel toward the shore, never sideways.\n- Wave size: {{WAVE_SIZE}} [small, medium, large].\n \nOutput the prompt (under 110 words), a negative prompt, and a note on how to keep wave speed natural (not sped-up).\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the beach photo.\n2. Wave size and mood?\n3. Which model?\nThen write.",
