    "id": "5d1e267c-e267-5a8f-b388-b68f4aedb38e",
    "title": "Landscape I2V: Ambient Sound Design Brief",
    "description": "Writes a matching sound design brief for an animated landscape clip, listing layers like wind, water, and birds with timing.",
    "rawContent": "My landscape clip is silent. Write a sound design brief I can use with a stock library or an AI sound tool.\n \nFor the scene I describe, give:\n1. Ambient bed (continuous): for example light wind, distant sea\n2. Detail sounds (occasional): birds, water drops, leaves\n3. Moving sounds that match visual motion (clouds are silent, water has a flow sound)\n4. Loudness guide in simple words: bed quiet, details medium\n5. Search keywords and text prompts for AI audio tools\n6. A timeline table: Second | Sound | Level\n \n### Rules: No music unless I ask. Avoid sounds that contradict the scene (no seagulls inland).\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the scene and what moves.\n2. Clip length?\n3. Mood?\nThen write the brief.",
