    "title": "Vehicle I2V: Night City Neon Light Trails",
    "description": "Creates a night-driving shot with neon reflections and light trails around a locked vehicle body.",
    "rawContent": "Build a cinematic night-city I2V prompt for my vehicle photo.\n \nFollow these stages:\nStage 1 - Describe the car's paint and surfaces so reflections stay believable (glossy black with sharp reflections).\nStage 2 - Describe the neon world: color palette, signs, wet asphalt.\nStage 3 - Add motion: light trails stretching horizontally, reflections sliding across the body panels.\nStage 4 - Lock the car body, headlights, and grille.\nStage 5 - Write the negative prompt.\n \n### Rules:\n- Reflections move, but the car's shape never does.\n- No readable brand text in the background.\n \n### Output\nFinal prompt under 120 words plus negative prompt plus a \"reflection test\": what to check in the first second.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the car and the city style.\n2. Color palette for the neon?\n3. Model?\nThen begin.",
