    "rawContent": "Write an I2V prompt for a rally car or truck racing across a desert track.\n \nInclude:\n1. Dust trail behind the vehicle, thick, billowing, and drifting in the wind direction\n2. Gravel spray from the tires, small and fast\n3. Suspension movement: a tiny bounce only, body shape unchanged\n4. Background landscape streaking horizontally, with distant mountains softly blurred\n5. Decals, number plate, and sponsor stickers: locked (describe them in the prompt)\n \n### Output\nPrompt under 120 words, negative prompt (no changing livery, no extra vehicles, no body deformation), and one camera variation (low angle).\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the vehicle photo and its decals.\n2. Time of day?\n3. Model and clip length?\nThen write.",
