    "description": "Animates a train or tram photo with passing motion, blurred platforms, and wind effects while keeping the carriages rigid.",
    "rawContent": "Create a prompt that makes my train photo feel fast and powerful.\n \nPlease address:\n- Carriage shapes, windows, and livery: rigid and unchanged; carriages remain evenly spaced\n- Platform and signs: horizontal motion blur from camera panning with the train\n- Rails: converging lines stay straight\n- Wind effect: a light flutter of paper or hair at the platform edge, very subtle\n- Sound cue suggestions for the editor (rumble, whoosh)\n \n### Output\n1. Final prompt under 110 words\n2. Negative prompt (no extra carriages, no bending windows, no melting rails)\n3. Setting advice: lower motion strength for long vehicles\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the train and station.\n2. Direction of travel?\n3. Which model?\nBegin after I answer.",
