    "description": "Animates an aircraft takeoff roll with runway streaks and heat shimmer while preserving fuselage, wings, and livery.",
    "rawContent": "Write an I2V prompt for an aircraft on a takeoff roll.\n \nElements:\n1. Aircraft: lock fuselage proportions, wing shape, engines, tail, and livery text\n2. Motion: forward acceleration along the runway, landing gear compressing slightly, wheel rotation\n3. Camera: side tracking at low height or ahead of the aircraft\n4. Runway: centerline dashes blurring and lights streaking\n5. Atmosphere: engine heat shimmer behind, not distorting the plane\n \n### Rules:\n- Wings never flex dramatically.\n- No liftoff in the clip unless I request it.\n \nOutput: prompt under 120 words, negative prompt (no extra engines, no changing tail number, no melting wings), and a note about realistic speed.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the aircraft photo.\n2. Takeoff roll only, or include liftoff?\n3. Model?\nThen write.",
