    "description": "Animates a speedboat photo with a white wake, water spray, and sunlit reflections while the hull and details stay fixed.",
    "rawContent": "Make my speedboat photo race across the water.\n \nThe prompt should describe:\n- Hull and windshield: rigid, with exact color and shape stated\n- Bow wave and wake: white spray rising and trailing behind in a V shape\n- Water surface: rough texture streaking horizontally\n- Sunlight: sparkles on the water that glide, not flicker\n- Background shoreline: soft blur, no shape change\n- Passengers: only hair and clothing in the wind, faces unchanged\n \n### Output\nPrompt under 120 words, negative prompt (no hull deformation, no additional boats, no face morphing), and tips for keeping spray from covering the whole boat.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the boat photo.\n2. Sea state: calm or rough?\n3. Which model?\nThen write.",
