    "rawContent": "Create a wet-road speed shot.\n \nThe prompt must contain:\n1. Rain: thin streaks, angle matching the car's speed\n2. Road: glossy asphalt with long reflections of lights and the car moving\n3. Tire spray: low and wide, trailing behind\n4. Windshield: wipers optional, only if visible in my photo\n5. Car body: water beads on the surface, but panel gaps, logo, and mirrors stay unchanged\n6. Grading: cool tones, headlights glowing\n \n### Output\nPrompt under 120 words, negative prompt (no flood, no changing car color, no duplicated headlights), and one night version.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the car photo.\n2. Day or night?\n3. Model?\nThen write.",
