    "description": "Applies a classic still-life painting look to product videos while keeping product shape, label, and motion accurate.",
    "rawContent": "Restyle my product video as an oil-painted still life for a premium brand film.\n \nPlease:\n1. Describe the painting look: rich pigments, soft window light, subtle canvas texture.\n2. Lock product shape, color, and label layout. State that text and logos stay readable and unchanged.\n3. Describe how the highlights on glass, metal, or fruit should appear (painted dabs of light).\n4. Maintain the original camera move and product rotation.\n5. Warn me which parts usually break (small label text) and give a fallback: overlay the logo in editing afterward.\n \n### Output\nPrompt, negative prompt, and a production tip list.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the product?\n2. Does the label have text or a logo?\n3. Which model?\nThen write.",
