    "id": "8292d587-3ee3-55c5-b90d-5f9260b878cd",
    "title": "Oil Painting V2V: Animated Painting Museum Exhibit",
    "description": "Designs a museum-style animated painting exhibit from a video with frame-like presentation, gentle motion, and a gallery mood.",
    "rawContent": "Help me create a \"living painting\" piece for a gallery screen or social post.\n \nGive me:\n1. A concept in 3 sentences\n2. The V2V prompt for a painterly look with slow, dignified motion\n3. A frame treatment: gilded frame or dark matte, how to add it in editing\n4. A short caption/wall text in museum voice (50 words)\n5. Audio idea: room tone, soft strings, or silence\n6. Export advice for a vertical screen vs a widescreen\n \n### Rule: Don't claim it is an authentic historic painting. Label it as an AI-assisted artwork.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the video about?\n2. Where will it be shown?\n3. Which style era?\nThen create it.",
