    "title": "Oil Painting V2V: Before-and-After Comparison Reel",
    "description": "Plans a split-screen or wipe reel comparing original footage and the painted version for social media or a portfolio.",
    "rawContent": "Design a before-and-after reel of my painted video.\n \nProvide:\n1. Three layout options: vertical wipe, split screen, and fade morph. Pros and cons of each.\n2. Timeline for a 15-second reel: second-by-second table.\n3. On-screen text ideas (short)\n4. A caption with a hook, 2 sentences of process, and a call to action\n5. 8 hashtag ideas\n6. A reminder to alignment-check: both versions must be the same length and frame size.\n \n### Output Format\nShort sections and a timeline table.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Which platform [Instagram, TikTok, YouTube Shorts, portfolio]?\n2. What is the video about?\n3. How long is the clip?\nThen build it.",
