    "description": "Reduces flickering outlines and uneven line weight in anime-style video using prompt wording and settings guidance.",
    "rawContent": "Line art that shakes is the number one anime V2V problem. Help me stabilize it.\n \nProvide:\n1. Phrases that encourage uniform line weight and clean contour lines (6 positive phrases)\n2. Phrases to avoid, which produce sketchy, vibrating lines (list 6)\n3. Fewer style words equals more stability: show how to reduce my prompt to a core of 3 style ideas\n4. Settings to test: lower style strength, higher consistency, fixed seed, shorter segments\n5. Post-production fix: temporal denoise, or re-line with edge filters\n6. A checklist to inspect three frames in a row for jitter\n \n### Output Format\nShort sections and one comparison table: Setting | Effect on lines | Risk.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste your current prompt.\n2. Describe what the lines do wrong.\n3. Which model?\nThen help.",
