    "description": "Creates painterly anime skies and nature backgrounds that stay still or drift gently in a controlled way.",
    "rawContent": "Make the sky and plants in my anime restyle look beautiful and calm.\n \nPlease:\n1. Describe a painted sky: cumulus clouds with soft white tops and blue shadow undersides, gradient from deep blue to pale at the horizon.\n2. Decide on motion: still, or clouds drifting at the original speed. Don't add motion that isn't in the source.\n3. Describe foliage: layered leaf clusters with simple shapes and highlights.\n4. Keep colors clean and bright.\n5. Write negative terms: noisy sky texture, flickering clouds, photographic grain.\n \n### Output\nPrompt segment for the backdrop (about 60 words), then the full prompt for the clip, and a negative prompt.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the outdoor scene.\n2. Time of day?\n3. Model?\nThen write.",
