    "rawContent": "Clothes and hair keep changing between frames. Write an outfit and hair lock.\n \nCreate:\n1. A fixed description block for each character: hair length and style, hair color (with a specific shade word), outfit parts and colors, accessories.\n2. How to place the block in the prompt (early, same words every time).\n3. Fixes for hair that flickers: simplify into 2-3 big hair shapes in the style description.\n4. Negative phrases: outfit color change, extra accessories, hair length shifting.\n5. A frame checklist: sleeves, collar, buttons, hair parting.\n \n### Output Format\nTemplate to fill in, then an example for a sample character, then the negative prompt.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe each character's outfit and hair.\n2. How many characters?\n3. Model?\nThen fill it in.",
