    "id": "cf6fb39d-d753-56e7-9423-8b99ba2c68a9",
    "title": "Anime V2V: Mixing Live Action and Anime in One Video",
    "description": "Plans hybrid videos that blend real footage and anime sections with clean transitions and consistent storytelling.",
    "rawContent": "I want a video that switches between real life and anime.\n \nCreate:\n1. Three storytelling reasons to switch (memory, imagination, emotion) with examples.\n2. Transition types: match cut, light flash, wipe by object, color drain. How to build each in editing.\n3. A shot list table with columns: Shot | Real or anime | Trigger for the switch.\n4. A matched prompt per anime shot to keep the same framing as the live shot.\n5. Color grading to make both parts feel related.\n \n### Output Format\nTables and short bullets.\n \n### Rule: Keep each anime clip under 6 seconds for stability.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the story or message?\n2. How long is the final video?\n3. Which tools do you use?\nThen plan.",
