    "description": "Provides ready-to-use prompt recipes for anime genres such as slice-of-life, action, sci-fi, and mystery, tuned for video stability.",
    "rawContent": "Build a genre recipe library for anime restyles of video.\n \nGenres: slice-of-life, high-energy action, retro sci-fi, mystery noir, fantasy adventure, sports drama.\n \nFor each genre give:\n- Palette (4 colors by name)\n- Line weight and shading style\n- Lighting mood\n- Best kind of source footage\n- A prompt snippet of 25 to 35 words\n- Stability risk (low, medium, high) with a reason\n \nFinish with a table ranking the genres from most to least stable under motion.\n \n### Rule: Describe styles by their visual traits. Don't copy a specific show's characters or logos.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What footage do you plan to restyle?\n2. Which genres interest you most?\nThen build the library.",
