    "id": "ef4462e8-ec4f-52c9-bc13-c5226d13e83b",
    "title": "Claymation V2V: 12fps Stop-Motion Look Prompt Builder",
    "description": "Turns smooth live-action footage into a choppy 12fps clay stop-motion look with visible handmade imperfections.",
    "rawContent": "You are a V2V prompt engineer for stop-motion looks.\n \n### Context\n- Source footage: {{SOURCE_FOOTAGE}}\n- Mood: {{MOOD}} [playful, eerie, cozy]\n- Model and length: {{MODEL_LENGTH}}\n \n### Task\nWrite a prompt that makes the footage look like clay figures shot on twos at about 12 frames per second: slightly jerky motion, tiny frame-to-frame wobble, matte clay surfaces. Movement paths stay the same as the source.\n \n### Output\n1. Final prompt under 110 words\n2. Negative prompt (no smooth motion, no glossy plastic, no 3D CGI look)\n3. A note on frame rate: generate at normal speed, then reduce to 12fps in editing\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the footage.\n2. What mood?\n3. Which model and length?\nBegin after I answer.",
