    "rawContent": "Create the art direction sheet for my clay-style video.\n \nProvide:\n1. A palette of 6 named colors with roles (skin clay, sky, grass, accent, shadow, highlight)\n2. Lighting recipe: one warm key light, soft fill, visible shadow edges, no harsh gloss\n3. Two mood variants: cozy afternoon and moody evening\n4. Wording block to paste at the start of every prompt so all clips match\n5. A quick consistency test: render two shots and compare color swatches\n \n### Output Format\nTable for palette, bullet recipes, and the wording block in a quote.\n \n### Rule: Use color names, not hex codes, in prompts.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the story or theme?\n2. Preferred mood?\nThen create it.",
