    "rawContent": "Make a clay stop-motion ad from my product footage.\n \nCover:\n1. Concept in two sentences (a tiny clay world reacting to the product)\n2. Prompt: product in clay form with the same silhouette, label area simplified\n3. Logo protection plan: restyle, then overlay the real logo in editing\n4. Props and set suggestions that suit the brand\n5. Motion: follow the original product movement\n6. Final line of copy for the end card\n \n### Output\nConcept, prompt under 110 words, negative prompt (no changed product shape, no extra products), and an editing checklist.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What product?\n2. Describe the footage.\n3. Which model?\nThen write.",
