    "description": "Creates gentle, kid-friendly clay story scenes from simple footage, with safe themes and clear, cheerful visuals.",
    "rawContent": "Help me make a short clay-style scene for children from simple footage (toys, pets, a family member who has agreed).\n \nGive me:\n1. A very short story idea (3 sentences) that fits my footage\n2. A cheerful V2V prompt with soft colors and rounded shapes\n3. Safety rules: friendly characters, no scary imagery, no real children's faces without parental consent\n4. A narration script of about 40 words, simple language\n5. Sound ideas: gentle music, soft effects\n \n### Output\nStory, prompt, negative prompt (no scary faces, no sharp teeth), and narration.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What footage do you have?\n2. Age group of the audience?\n3. Which model?\nThen write.",
