    "id": "0a7d5002-5afc-54bf-969f-fac324ad4a43",
    "title": "Claymation V2V: Nature and Animal Footage in Clay",
    "description": "Restyles animals and nature clips as clay creatures and handmade scenery, keeping species and movement recognizable.",
    "rawContent": "Convert my animal and nature clip into a clay world.\n \nPrompt must include:\n1. Animal: species, color pattern, body proportions as chubby clay forms, lock markings\n2. Movement: same gait and speed as the source, with stop-motion stepping\n3. Environment: sculpted clay hills, wool trees, translucent clay water with small ridges\n4. Lighting: warm studio lamp\n5. Small flaws: fingerprints on fur\n \n### Output\nPrompt under 120 words, negative prompt (no extra limbs, no realistic fur, no species change), and one tip: animals in fast motion need shorter clips.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What animal and what action?\n2. Describe the setting.\n3. Model?\nThen write.",
