    "description": "Designs a stop-motion title sequence with handmade lettering, clay props, and timing for a short film or channel intro.",
    "rawContent": "Design a 10-second clay stop-motion title sequence.\n \nDeliver:\n1. Concept (2 sentences)\n2. Lettering: clay letters, ropes of clay, or cut felt. Pros and cons of each\n3. Shot list table: Second | Visual | Motion | Sound\n4. Prompt for the background plate and a note to add real title text in editing (AI text is unreliable)\n5. Color and prop palette\n6. Export advice: loopable, 16:9 and 9:16 versions\n \n### Rule: Use only the title I provide.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the title of your project?\n2. What is it about?\n3. Which editor do you use?\nThen design it.",
