    "description": "Creates a foley and music plan with tactile clay sounds, squishes, and stepping rhythm matched to the 12fps feel.",
    "rawContent": "Write a sound plan for my clay film.\n \nInclude:\n1. Foley list: squishy footsteps, clay squeak, thumps on a wooden table, cloth rustle, small clicks\n2. Rhythm: sound hits aligned to every held frame group for a stop-motion beat\n3. Music style: quirky pizzicato, xylophone, or ukulele, tempo range (no named songs)\n4. Ambience: room tone with a studio feel\n5. Timeline table: Time | Action | Sound | Level\n6. AI audio tool prompts to generate each foley element\n \n### Output Format\nShort sections and one timeline table.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the scenes.\n2. Clip length?\n3. Mood?\nThen write the plan.",
