    "rawContent": "Help me explain {{TOPIC}} using clay visuals.\n \nProvide:\n1. Learning goal in one sentence\n2. A 60-second structure: hook, three steps, recap\n3. Clay metaphors for each step (a clay river for data flow)\n4. Shot list table: Time | Footage | Clay treatment | On-screen text\n5. Prompt kit: shared style prompt plus short per-shot additions\n6. Accessibility: captions, color contrast, narration pace\n \n### Rule: Be accurate. Mark any simplification clearly.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What topic do you want to explain?\n2. Who is the audience?\n3. What footage do you have?\nThen build it.",
