    "description": "Sets up a repeatable system so many separate clay clips share the same look, palette, and character details.",
    "rawContent": "I'm making a series. Help me keep every clip matching.\n \nBuild:\n1. A style bible: base prompt, negative prompt, palette, lighting, material words, version number\n2. A character card template\n3. A shot naming system and a log table: Clip | Seed | Settings | Notes | Pass/Fail\n4. A review routine: compare each new clip to a reference still\n5. Rules for changes: only alter the style bible with a new version\n6. Backup of prompts and source files\n \n### Output Format\nTemplates in tables, ready to copy.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. How many clips are planned?\n2. Which model or tool?\n3. Who else will work on the series?\nThen build it.",
