    "description": "Provides a compact test grid for style strength, consistency, and seed to find a stable clay look quickly.",
    "rawContent": "Make me a small test plan I can finish in under 10 runs.\n \nPlan:\n1. Round 1: three style strengths with identical prompt and seed. Table of runs.\n2. Round 2: best strength with three consistency levels.\n3. Round 3: best combo with three seeds.\n4. Score each: clay texture, face stability, motion match, flicker (1-5).\n5. Pick the winner and save settings to the style bible.\n6. Quick rules for when to stop testing.\n \n### Rule: Map my tool's controls to these names; don't assume they match.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Which tool?\n2. What is your clip like?\n3. What is your biggest issue?\nThen build the grid.",
