    "title": "Corporate Avatar: Wardrobe and Brand Color Lock",
    "description": "Locks clothing details, accessories, and brand colors so the presenter's outfit never shifts between clips.",
    "rawContent": "Create a wardrobe lock sheet for my avatar.\n \nInclude:\n1. Outfit description with exact parts: jacket cut, shirt collar, tie or no tie, buttons, pocket square, lapel pin\n2. Colors by name, matching my brand palette\n3. Fabric texture words that stay stable (matte wool, smooth cotton)\n4. Patterns to avoid because they shimmer (thin stripes, herringbone)\n5. A reusable text block for every prompt\n6. Negative phrases: changing collar, shifting tie, appearing logos\n \n### Output\nThe wardrobe sheet as a fill-in template plus a sample filled version.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is your brand palette?\n2. Dress code?\n3. Male-coded, female-coded, or neutral presenter styling?\nThen build it.",
