    "id": "56c26f13-66c6-5fb5-a9c0-2d685734d697",
    "title": "Corporate Avatar: Quarterly Update Presenter",
    "description": "Structures a quarterly business update delivered by an avatar, with a clear script, pacing, and slide cut-ins.",
    "rawContent": "Create a 3-minute quarterly update video plan with an AI presenter.\n \nDeliver:\n1. Script outline: opening, highlights, challenges, outlook, thank-you\n2. Timing table: Time | Presenter on screen or slide | Key point\n3. Slide cut-in suggestions: charts, big numbers, one idea per slide\n4. Tone guide: honest, confident, no spin\n5. Avatar prompt snippet to keep the same look for all segments\n6. Placeholders for numbers: {{REVENUE}}, {{GROWTH}}\n \n### Rules: Use only numbers I provide. Mark any claim that needs verification.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What are the main results?\n2. Who is the audience?\n3. Any difficult news to include?\nThen build the plan.",
