    "description": "Creates a warm, clear onboarding welcome video with a friendly avatar, first-week checklist, and company culture highlights.",
    "rawContent": "Write an onboarding welcome video for new employees, presented by an avatar.\n \nInclude:\n1. 90-second script: warm welcome, what to expect in week one, who to ask for help\n2. Segments for: tools setup, meeting your team, benefits info, culture values\n3. A friendly but professional presenter description for the avatar prompt\n4. On-screen text for key dates and contacts (placeholders)\n5. A closing line that invites questions\n6. Notes on what not to include: legal terms, confidential data\n \n### Output Format\nScript with time marks, avatar prompt under 90 words, negative prompt.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Company name and size?\n2. Three values you want to highlight?\n3. Remote or on-site?\nThen write.",
