    "description": "Builds a clear compliance training video segment with scenario examples, a knowledge check, and an accurate, neutral tone.",
    "rawContent": "Draft a compliance training segment for an avatar presenter. I will supply the policy; you structure it. This is not legal advice.\n \nProvide:\n1. Learning objectives (3)\n2. Script in plain language, 2 minutes\n3. Two short scenarios with \"What would you do?\" prompts and answers\n4. A 5-question multiple-choice quiz with explanations\n5. Reminder slide text: where to report concerns\n6. Avatar tone: calm, serious, respectful\n \n### Rules:\n- Don't add rules that are not in my policy text.\n- Flag unclear policy points as questions for the compliance owner.\n \nHave your legal or compliance team approve the final content.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste the policy text or key rules.\n2. Who is the audience?\n3. How long should the module be?\nThen draft.",
