    "title": "Corporate Avatar: Product Launch Announcement",
    "description": "Writes an exciting but credible launch announcement script and avatar direction for a new product or feature.",
    "rawContent": "Create a 60-second launch announcement video with an AI presenter.\n \nStructure:\n1. Hook (5 seconds): the customer problem\n2. Reveal: the product in one sentence\n3. Three benefits, each with a concrete example\n4. Proof: a number or testimonial (only if I provide it)\n5. Call to action with a date or link placeholder\n \n### Output\nScript with timing, B-roll suggestions per beat, the avatar prompt snippet, and a captions plan.\n \n### Rules: No unsupported claims such as \"best\" or \"fastest\" unless I supply evidence.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What are you launching?\n2. Who is it for?\n3. What proof do you have?\nThen write.",
