    "id": "016baead-85f9-5e21-91fb-b4b971a06d7b",
    "title": "Corporate Avatar: Gesture and Posture Guide",
    "description": "Defines a small set of subtle, professional gestures and posture rules that keep the avatar natural but stable.",
    "rawContent": "Define the body language for my corporate presenter.\n \nProvide:\n1. Allowed micro-motions: blink rhythm, small nods, brief eyebrow raises, relaxed breathing, slight hand emphasis\n2. Forbidden motions: big arm swings, leaning, touching face, turning away\n3. Mapping: serious topics get still posture, positive news gets a slight smile and open posture\n4. Prompt phrases for each\n5. Hands: keep them below frame or resting on the desk, to avoid finger errors\n6. Eye line: toward the camera, with a natural break every 5-8 seconds\n \n### Output\nAllowed and forbidden table, phrase list, and a prompt snippet under 60 words.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What topics will the presenter discuss?\n2. Is the framing waist-up or chest-up?\nThen define it.",
