    "id": "733cfc7f-69d7-5fa9-8674-cabdfe4d5560",
    "title": "Corporate Avatar: Framing, Lower Thirds, and Layout",
    "description": "Plans screen layout for avatar videos including framing, lower-third titles, logos, and safe margins for all devices.",
    "rawContent": "Design the on-screen layout for my presenter video.\n \nProvide:\n1. Framing choices: chest-up, waist-up, off-center with copy space. Pros and cons.\n2. Rule-of-thirds placement with eye line at the upper third\n3. Lower-third design: name, title, font, animation timing (appear at 2s, stay 5s)\n4. Logo placement and size in a corner with safe margins (about 5 percent)\n5. Slide or graphic zones that avoid covering the face\n6. Mobile check: text size readable on a phone\n \n### Output\nLayout description, a text diagram using boxes, and a spec table.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. 16:9 or 9:16?\n2. Brand colors and fonts?\n3. What graphics will appear?\nThen design.",
