    "id": "3b8972e0-7a46-5c35-835a-87e109add724",
    "title": "Corporate Avatar: Leadership Message With Consent and Disclosure",
    "description": "Plans an internal leadership message delivered by an avatar of a consenting executive with clear disclosure to employees.",
    "rawContent": "Help me plan an internal message where an avatar of our executive delivers the update. The executive has agreed in writing.\n \nProvide:\n1. Consent checklist: written approval, approved script, scope of use, expiry, who can edit\n2. Disclosure line shown at the start: \"This video features an AI avatar of [Name], created with their permission.\"\n3. Script rules: only words the executive approved; no invented quotes\n4. Where not to use it: sensitive news such as layoffs, where a human should appear\n5. Security: who can access the avatar model and audit logs\n \n### Output Format\nChecklist, sample disclosure, and a short script structure.\n \n### Rule: Never impersonate a real person without consent.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Who is the executive and what is the message?\n2. Has consent been documented?\nThen plan.",
