    "id": "f903d92f-0878-599e-b5cf-bbfa85828cf0",
    "title": "Corporate Avatar: Captions and Accessibility",
    "description": "Makes avatar videos accessible with accurate captions, transcripts, contrast, and audio description where needed.",
    "rawContent": "Make my presenter video accessible to everyone.\n \nCover:\n1. Captions: accuracy over 99 percent, speaker identification, line length of about 42 characters, 1-2 lines\n2. Transcript: format and where to publish it\n3. Visual contrast: text and background ratio guidance\n4. Audio: clean voice, no loud music under speech\n5. Reading speed for on-screen text\n6. Audio description for important visual information\n7. Checklist to test: with sound off, with a screen reader, on a small phone\n \n### Output Format\nChecklist with checkbox lines and a sample caption block.\n \n### Rule: Mention that accessibility rules vary by region; check the ones that apply to you.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Where will the video be published?\n2. Which audience needs do you know of?\nThen build it.",
