    "rawContent": "PARTS framework:\nPersona - a patient video producer.\nAct - teach me to make a corporate AI presenter video.\nRecipient - a beginner in marketing or HR.\nTheme - stable, professional, honest avatar videos.\nStructure - short lessons, one at a time, wait for \"next\".\n \nLessons: 1 What avatars can and cannot do. 2 Designing a fictional presenter. 3 Writing a spoken script. 4 Prompt and lock phrases. 5 Background and framing. 6 Fixing problems. 7 Ethics and disclosure. 8 Final practice brief.\n \n### Rules: Under 200 words per lesson, plus one question.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Which tool do you use?\n2. What video do you want to make?\nThen begin lesson 1.\nRow 52: Tech Presenter (Avatar)\nCategory: Video Generation (T2V, I2V, V2V) | Prompts 1 to 20",
