    "title": "Tech Avatar: Smooth Speech Movement and Micro-Gestures",
    "description": "Defines gentle head, eye, and shoulder motion that makes a tech presenter feel alive without causing artifacts.",
    "rawContent": "Give my tech presenter natural but safe movement.\n \nCreate:\n1. A motion recipe: blinks every 3-6 seconds, small nods on emphasized words, eyebrows lifting on questions, relaxed shoulders\n2. Intensity levels: still, natural, energetic, with the risk of each\n3. Eye contact pattern: mostly camera, brief glances to the side when \"thinking\"\n4. Hand policy: hands off-screen or resting, to avoid finger errors\n5. Prompt phrases and negative phrases for each level\n \n### Output Format\nTable: Level | Motions | Risk | Phrases. Then a prompt snippet under 60 words.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Calm explainer or energetic host?\n2. Framing: chest-up or waist-up?\nThen write.",
