    "description": "Designs clean, modern studio backgrounds with soft gradients, LED strips, and shelves that stay perfectly static.",
    "rawContent": "Design a modern tech studio background that never moves.\n \nGive 4 concepts:\n1. Dark gradient wall with a thin LED strip\n2. Light minimalist desk with a plant\n3. Shelf wall with books and tiny gadgets\n4. Blurred home-office with a monitor glow\n \nFor each: a 40-word description, colors, light direction, and the flicker risks (LED pulsing, screen content, reflections).\n \nRules: LED strips must be steady, not animated. Screens should be off or show a fixed image.\n \nEnd with a recommendation and a prompt snippet under 50 words.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Your brand colors?\n2. Mood: serious, playful, futuristic?\nThen design.",
