    "description": "Writes a snappy intro for product demo videos with a hook, value statement, and a clean handoff to the screen recording.",
    "rawContent": "Write a 20-second intro for a product demo.\n \nStructure:\n1. Hook (one sentence, a problem the viewer feels)\n2. What the product does in plain language\n3. What the viewer will see in the demo (three items)\n4. Handoff line: \"Let's jump in.\"\n \nAlso provide:\n- Avatar delivery notes: pace, emphasis words, smile moments\n- A text overlay for each beat\n- A version for a 10-second cut\n \n### Rules: No unverified claims. Use {{PRODUCT_NAME}} and {{KEY_BENEFIT}} placeholders if I give none.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the product and who uses it?\n2. Biggest benefit?\n3. Tone: professional, witty, bold?\nThen write.",
