    "description": "Sets up a repeatable weekly recap show format with segments, scripts, and a consistent avatar host.",
    "rawContent": "Create a weekly 4-minute tech recap show format.\n \nDeliver:\n1. Segment structure with timings: cold open, 3 stories, quick hits, closing\n2. Script template with placeholders\n3. Rules for sourcing: cite each story's source, avoid rumors, label opinion\n4. A standard intro and outro line\n5. Visual plan: lower third per story, a source card on screen\n6. Production checklist from research to publish (about 2 hours)\n7. Avatar prompt block reused every week\n \n### Rule: Verify facts before publishing. Don't write stories you can't check.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Which part of tech do you cover?\n2. Tone: serious or casual?\n3. Posting day?\nThen build.",
