    "id": "8972559c-bd6c-590f-8b3b-750a9bff8e02",
    "title": "Medical Avatar: Scrub Texture and Hair Bun Lock",
    "description": "Stops fabric shimmer and hair flicker by choosing stable scrub colors and hair styles and writing precise lock phrases.",
    "rawContent": "Fabric and hair flicker are the main stability problems. Help me solve them.\n \nProvide:\n1. Stable choices: solid matte scrubs in teal, navy, or gray; low neat bun or short hair\n2. Risky choices: patterned scrubs, shiny fabric, loose strands, lanyards with tiny print\n3. Lock phrases for neckline, sleeve length, seams, hair shape and parting\n4. Negative phrases: shimmering fabric, flickering hair strands, changing collar\n5. A 5-second silent test render to detect boiling textures before the full video\n \n### Output Format\nChoose | Avoid table, phrase list, and test steps.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Preferred scrub color and hair style?\n2. Which tool?\nThen build it.",
