    "id": "075a78e2-c910-5ce6-96d8-b71f1ab5d322",
    "title": "Medical Avatar: Clinical Background Design",
    "description": "Designs clean, believable, static clinical backdrops such as a clinic office or consultation room without flicker risks.",
    "rawContent": "Design backgrounds for a health-education video that stay perfectly still.\n \nGive 4 options: bright consultation room, softly blurred clinic corridor, plain wall with an anatomical poster, home-office with a bookshelf.\n \nFor each:\n- 40-word description with colors and materials\n- Lighting: soft, clean, neutral white\n- Risks: monitors showing readable data, moving blinds, other people, ticking clocks\n- A privacy note: no real patient information, no readable records\n \nFinish with a recommendation and a prompt snippet under 50 words.\n \n### Rule: Avoid equipment that implies a specific procedure unless the topic needs it.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What type of health topic do you cover?\n2. Calm or energetic mood?\nThen design.",
