    "description": "Writes clear on-screen and spoken disclaimers that explain the avatar is AI and the video is educational only.",
    "rawContent": "Draft disclaimers for my health-education video series. This is a drafting aid, not legal advice.\n \nProvide:\n1. A short spoken opening line (under 15 words) that says the presenter is an AI avatar\n2. An on-screen disclaimer (under 30 words): educational only, not medical advice, consult your healthcare provider\n3. An emergency line: \"If this is an emergency, contact your local emergency number.\" Leave region placeholders.\n4. A description-box version (60 words) with sources and review date placeholders\n5. Rules for where each appears and for how long\n \n### Do NOT: imply the avatar is a licensed professional.\n \nHave legal and clinical reviewers approve the wording.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. In which country will the videos be viewed?\n2. Who reviews your content?\nThen draft.",
