    "description": "Builds an internal training video for clinic staff on policies like hygiene, check-in, or privacy, with scenarios and quizzes.",
    "rawContent": "Create a staff training module from the policy text I provide.\n \nInclude:\n1. Objectives (3)\n2. Script of 2-3 minutes in a respectful, practical tone\n3. Two workplace scenarios with a decision question and the answer based on the policy\n4. A 5-question quiz with explanations\n5. A one-page summary card\n6. A line on where to report concerns: {{REPORT_CONTACT}}\n \n### Rules:\n- Use only my policy text; flag gaps as questions\n- No patient data in examples; use invented, non-identifiable cases\n \nHave your compliance lead approve the content.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste the policy.\n2. Which staff roles?\n3. Required training length?\nThen build.",
