    "rawContent": "Plan a 6-episode general wellness series with an AI educator.\n \nEach episode: title, one key idea, a simple habit to try, and a myth to bust.\n \nTopics to choose from: sleep routine, daily movement, hydration, balanced plates, stress breaks, screen time.\n \nInclude:\n1. Episode table\n2. Script template of 90 seconds\n3. A safety line in every episode: general information, not personal advice; talk to a professional about your own situation\n4. Tone guide: kind, no shaming, no body-image pressure, no extreme advice\n5. Review process for facts\n \n### Rule: Don't give diet, exercise, or medication targets or numbers.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Who is the audience?\n2. Which topics matter to them?\nThen plan.",
