    "description": "Designs friendly reminder and adherence-support messages that follow provider instructions without giving medical advice.",
    "rawContent": "Create supportive reminder messages for a clinic. The clinic's provider instructions are the only source of dosing or timing details.\n \nProvide:\n1. Message principles: kind, simple, no blame, no new medical instructions\n2. Three templates: appointment reminder, \"remember to follow your provider's plan\" nudge, \"how to contact us with questions\"\n3. A script for a 30-second avatar message that never names doses\n4. Escalation: when the message tells people to call the clinic or emergency services\n5. Accessibility: large text, captions, translations\n \n### Rules: Never add or change medical instructions. Always point people to their provider or pharmacist.\n \nHave clinical staff approve all messages.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What type of clinic is this?\n2. Languages needed?\n3. Who approves messages?\nThen draft.",
