    "title": "Medical Avatar: Caregiver Support Video Series",
    "description": "Plans compassionate support videos for caregivers with practical tips, self-care reminders, and links to community resources.",
    "rawContent": "Create a short video series for family caregivers.\n \nEpisodes (choose 5): getting organized, communicating with the care team, asking for help, taking breaks, handling hard days, safe home basics.\n \nFor each: a 90-second script, one practical tip, one self-care reminder, and a resources line with placeholders.\n \nTone guide: warm, validating, never preachy. Avoid \"you should\" language.\n \nInclude:\n1. A gentle content note at the start of emotionally heavy episodes\n2. A crisis line mention with a {{LOCAL_SUPPORT_NUMBER}} placeholder\n3. A review checklist for tone and accuracy\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What condition or situation do caregivers face (general or specific)?\n2. Which region?\nThen write.",
