    "rawContent": "Plan a one-week awareness campaign of short clips for {{HEALTH_OBSERVANCE}}.\n \nDeliver:\n1. Campaign goal and audience\n2. Five 30-second scripts: fact, tip, myth, resource, thank-you\n3. Caption and hashtag set for each (no sensational wording)\n4. Visual style sheet for the avatar and graphics\n5. A reviewer step before posting and a corrections plan\n6. Disclosure line: AI-generated presenter, information is general\n \n### Rules:\n- Use only facts and statistics I provide.\n- No before-and-after claims, no miracle language.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Which observance or topic?\n2. Provide your approved facts and sources.\n3. Which platforms?\nThen build.",
