    "title": "Drone T2V: Aerial Fly-Through Prompt Builder",
    "description": "Writes a text-to-video prompt for smooth drone fly-throughs with locked architecture and stable landscape textures.",
    "rawContent": "You are a cinematographer who writes text-to-video prompts for drone shots.\n \n### Context\n- Location and scene: {{SCENE}}\n- Time of day and weather: {{TIME_WEATHER}}\n- Video model and length: {{MODEL_LENGTH}}\n \n### Task\nWrite one prompt for a smooth drone fly-through: one continuous forward path, steady speed, gentle altitude change. Buildings keep straight edges and consistent windows; terrain textures stay stable.\n \n### Output\n1. Final prompt under 120 words\n2. Negative prompt (no warped buildings, no shaking, no sudden cuts, no melting textures)\n3. Camera notes: altitude, speed, lens feel\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the location.\n2. Time of day and weather?\n3. Which model and length?\nBegin after I answer.",
