    "id": "8b840c8f-babe-56ca-8c26-01a65e4ee32d",
    "title": "Drone T2V: City Skyline Dusk Flight",
    "description": "Writes a cinematic dusk fly-through over a city with lit windows, moving traffic, and stable skyline geometry.",
    "rawContent": "Create a drone shot gliding over a city at dusk.\n \nInclude:\n1. Sky: gradient from deep blue to warm orange at the horizon\n2. Buildings: rigid skyscrapers with steady window lights (no random twinkling)\n3. Streets: slow light trails of cars as gentle lines\n4. Camera: forward glide at moderate altitude, slight downward tilt\n5. Depth: layers of buildings with atmospheric haze\n6. Avoid: readable signs, logos, crowds\n \n### Output\nPrompt under 120 words, negative prompt (no flickering windows, no warped towers, no text), and a note about adding sound in post.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Which city style (modern, historic, futuristic)?\n2. Any landmark to feature (generic only)?\n3. Model?\nThen write.",
