    "rawContent": "Write an aerial prompt for a historic or fictional ruin site.\n \nContents:\n1. Subject: a fictional ancient temple complex or castle ruin (not a real protected site, unless I specify and it is recognizable)\n2. Stonework: weathered blocks with consistent coursing, arches that stay round\n3. Surroundings: grass, scattered trees, a path\n4. Light: low sun with long shadows\n5. Camera: wide orbit then slow push toward the main structure\n6. Cultural respect: avoid sacred imagery misuse; no modern graffiti or people\n \n### Output\nPrompt under 120 words, negative prompt (no collapsing walls, no changing arches, no modern objects), and a note on labeling it as AI-generated.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Fictional or inspired by a real region?\n2. Era and style?\n3. Model?\nThen write.",
