    "rawContent": "Build a flight vocabulary guide for text-to-video drone shots.\n \nCover: forward fly-through, orbit, reveal from behind an object, rise, descent, lateral slide, top-down, follow, pull-back reveal.\n \nFor each:\n- Plain meaning\n- Best subjects\n- Prompt phrase (one sentence)\n- Stability rating: high, medium, low, with the reason\n- Common failure\n \nEnd with a table matching goals to moves: drama, scale, intimacy, speed.\n \n### Rule: Recommend one move per clip.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What subjects do you film (cities, nature, buildings)?\n2. Which model?\nThen build the guide.",
