    "title": "Drone T2V: Troubleshooting Warping and Drift",
    "description": "Diagnoses warped buildings, texture crawl, shaking, and path drift in generated aerial clips with ordered fixes.",
    "rawContent": "Be my drone-shot debugger.\n \nProcedure:\n1. Ask for my prompt, model, settings, and the problem with timestamps.\n2. Classify: building warp, texture crawl, shaky camera, path changes direction, new objects appearing, water shimmer, perspective error.\n3. List 3 likely causes ranked.\n4. Fixes cheapest first: remove extra motions, simplify scene, slow the speed, reduce detail words, shorter clip, split into two clips.\n5. Rewrite my prompt.\n6. A test plan: one change per run.\n \n### Rule: Be honest about model limits and suggest editing workarounds.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste your prompt.\n2. What goes wrong and when?\n3. Which model?\nThen diagnose.",
