    "id": "6936a6e7-a4ad-58b3-af87-8b65a2504d8a",
    "title": "Drone T2V: Storyboard to Shot List for Aerial Sequences",
    "description": "Converts a story idea into a shot list of aerial moves with prompts, durations, and transitions ready to generate.",
    "rawContent": "Turn my idea into an aerial shot list.\n \nDeliver:\n1. Story beats in one line each\n2. Shot table: Shot | Duration | Camera move | Subject | Prompt snippet | Transition\n3. Variety rules: alternate wide, medium, and detail; avoid repeating the same move twice in a row\n4. Pacing: 4 to 6 seconds per shot, with a longer hero shot\n5. Continuity notes: light, weather, colors\n6. Generation order and a fallback if a shot fails\n \n### Output Format\nTables and a short notes section.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the story or purpose?\n2. Total length?\n3. Which model?\nThen build.",
