    "id": "83f8905a-ad3a-543f-ae63-c766c497cd7e",
    "title": "Family Table: Multi-Generation Dinner Scene Builder",
    "description": "Creates a T2V prompt for a family dinner with grandparents, parents, and kids where every person keeps a unique face and outfit.",
    "rawContent": "Write me a prompt for a video of a family dinner. Keep it simple but make sure nobody looks like anyone else.\n \nUse {{FAMILY_MEMBERS}} with their ages, then:\n- Give each person one hair detail and one clothing color.\n- Seat them in order around the table.\n- Add a gentle action like passing dishes or laughing.\n \nOutput:\n1. The video prompt (about 120 words)\n2. A one-line seating order\n \nDon't add extra relatives or change ages.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Who is at the table and how old are they?\n2. What does the room look like?\n3. What is the mood [cozy, festive, tense]?\nBegin after I answer.",
