    "id": "e2e54f61-c541-5e99-b777-a15bc6c04d05",
    "title": "Height Ratio: Body Proportion Lock for Group Clips",
    "description": "Locks relative heights, builds, and proportions across characters so a child never turns adult-sized and tall characters stay tall.",
    "rawContent": "### Task\nTurn my character list into height and build comparisons a video model can follow.\n \n### Steps\n1. Read {{CHARACTER_LIST_WITH_HEIGHTS}}.\n2. Rank characters from tallest to shortest.\n3. Rewrite each with a comparison phrase, for example \"head reaches only to Marco's shoulder.\"\n4. Add a build word (slim, broad, stocky) per person.\n5. Produce a prompt sentence that states the full ranking.\n \n### Output\nRanking list, then one paragraph under 100 words.\n \n### Do NOT: use exact centimeters alone; models respond better to comparisons.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. List your characters and their rough heights.\n2. Does anyone sit, crouch, or use props that change height?\nI will start after I get your reply.",
    "variables": [
      {
        "name": "CHARACTER_LIST_WITH_HEIGHTS",
        "defaultValue": "",
        "description": "Parameter for Character List With Heights"
      }
    ],
    "category": "Design",
