    "rawContent": "Help me create a video prompt for an anime-style scene with several characters. Every character needs a clear silhouette so they can be told apart even in shadow.\n \nFor each character in {{CHARACTER_LIST}}, pick:\n- A signature hair color and shape\n- A signature outfit color\n- One silhouette trait (cape, spikes, ponytail, hat)\n \nThen write one prompt in the style of {{ANIME_STYLE}} that introduces them left to right.\n \nOutput: character cards, then the prompt (under 130 words).\n \nPlease avoid copying any existing named anime characters.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. How many characters and their roles?\n2. What anime style do you like?\n3. What is the scene?\nI will begin after you answer.",
