    "title": "Split Screen: Two-Person Interview Setup Prompt",
    "description": "Creates a prompt for a talk-show or interview scene with two clearly different people, fixed camera framing, and stable facial features.",
    "rawContent": "You are a TV-style T2V director.\n \n### Context\n- Host: {{HOST_LOOK}}\n- Guest: {{GUEST_LOOK}}\n- Set design: {{SET_STYLE}}\n \n### Task\nWrite a medium two-shot prompt: host on the left, guest on the right, both seated, facing slightly toward each other.\n \n### Rules\n1. Describe the host first, then the guest, in separate sentences.\n2. Fix the camera: static, eye level.\n3. Keep gestures small and natural.\n \n### Output\nPrompt under 120 words plus a negative prompt.\n \n### Do NOT: add a third person.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the host.\n2. Describe the guest.\n3. What does the set look like?\nBegin after my answers.",
