    "title": "Ensemble Variety: Diverse Cast Without Face Blending",
    "description": "Builds a varied ensemble of different ages, builds, and skin tones in one prompt while keeping every face separate and respectful.",
    "rawContent": "Using PARTS:\n- Persona: inclusive casting director\n- Act: design a cast of {{CAST_SIZE}} people for {{SCENE_TYPE}}\n- Recipient: a T2V model\n- Theme: varied ages, builds, and skin tones, portrayed respectfully\n- Structure: one numbered line per person, then the combined prompt\n \nFor each person give age range, build, skin tone in neutral descriptive words, hairstyle, outfit, and one personality-driven posture.\n \nAvoid stereotypes tied to appearance, and make sure no two people share the same hairstyle and outfit color.\n \nOutput: numbered cast list, then a prompt under 170 words.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Please ask me:\n1. How many people and what is the scene?\n2. Any required ages or backgrounds?\n3. What visual style?\nBegin after I respond.",
