    "description": "Fixes hair, clothing, and blanket behavior in zero-gravity prompts so they float naturally instead of hanging down or flowing like wind.",
    "rawContent": "You will rewrite my prompt so hair and cloth act correctly in zero gravity.\n \nOriginal prompt: {{ORIGINAL_PROMPT}}\n \n### Check for these errors\n1. Words like \"flowing in the wind\" or \"hanging\" or \"draping\"\n2. Fabric falling toward the floor\n3. Hair behaving like it is underwater\n \n### Correct behavior to describe\n- Hair spreads outward and moves slowly in a cloud\n- Loose fabric hovers and gently rotates\n- Motion starts when the body moves, then fades slowly\n \nOutput: Corrected prompt, then a 3-line list of what you changed.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste your prompt.\n2. Does the character have long hair or loose clothes?\nBegin after I answer.",
