    "title": "Cinematic Rig: Weightless Camera Movement Designer",
    "description": "Plans slow, floating camera moves that match a zero-gravity feel, including drifting, rotating, and gentle push-ins.",
    "rawContent": "As an experienced cinematographer, design camera movement for a zero-gravity clip.\n \nScene summary: {{SCENE_SUMMARY}}\n \nOffer 4 camera options, each with:\n- Name (for example Slow Orbit, Drift Pull-Back, Roll Reveal)\n- Exact wording to paste into a prompt\n- Best use case\n- A warning about what could go wrong\n \nThen recommend one option for my scene and write the full final prompt.\n \nKeep camera speed slow and smooth in all options.\n \n### Do NOT: use handheld shake or fast whip pans.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Summarize the scene.\n2. What mood do you want [dreamy, tense, documentary]?\nBegin after your answers.",
