    "rawContent": "Create two matched prompts for the same character {{CHARACTER}} in two environments.\n \nPrompt A: rotating habitat with artificial gravity\n- Floor curves upward in the distance\n- Objects rest on surfaces\n- Liquids pool along the outer wall\n- Slight Coriolis-like curve in thrown objects\n \nPrompt B: non-rotating free-float module\n- No floor, no up or down\n- Objects drift\n- Liquids form spheres\n \nKeep the character, lighting, and camera identical so only physics differs.\n \nOutput: both prompts under 120 words each plus a short list of differences.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Who is the character?\n2. What action should happen in both versions?\n3. What camera angle?\nBegin after I answer.",
