    "title": "Tumble Fix: Unwanted Falling and Gravity Cue Remover",
    "description": "Reviews a zero-gravity prompt to remove hidden gravity words and cues that make video models drop objects or ground characters.",
    "rawContent": "Please go through my prompt and remove anything that suggests gravity.\n \nPrompt: {{USER_PROMPT}}\n \nLook for words like: stand, sit, rest, fall, drop, pour, hang, lay, ground, floor, shelf, table, and also hidden cues like \"drops of sweat\" or \"hair falls.\"\n \nFor each one:\n1. Quote it\n2. Say why it breaks the effect\n3. Give a replacement\n \nThen give the cleaned prompt.\n \nKeep my original style and length as much as possible.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste your prompt.\n2. What do you see going wrong in the video?\nBegin after I answer.",
