    "rawContent": "Build a 5-shot prompt pack for a short zero-gravity film titled {{FILM_TITLE}} about {{STORY_IDEA}}.\n \nStep 1: Write a shared \"physics rulebook\" of 6 lines (floating, fluids, suits, cables, light, camera) to paste into every prompt.\nStep 2: Write 5 shots: establishing, character close-up, object interaction, liquid moment, closing wide.\nStep 3: For each shot, give prompt (under 100 words) plus a one-line negative prompt.\nStep 4: Check that no shot breaks the rulebook.\n \nRepeat the rulebook at the top of every shot so each clip works alone.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the story?\n2. Who are the characters?\n3. What visual style and video model?\n4. How long is each clip?\nBegin only after my answers.\nRow 57: Stable Face Replacement (V2V)\nCategory: Video Generation (T2V, I2V, V2V) | Prompts 1 to 20",
