    "rawContent": "Help me describe the lighting so the new face looks like it belongs in the video.\n \nGive me a prompt that covers:\n1. Key light direction: {{LIGHT_DIRECTION}}\n2. Light color and warmth: {{LIGHT_COLOR}}\n3. Softness (hard or diffused)\n4. Shadow behavior when the head turns\n5. Skin highlights and sheen\n \nAlso add a step where the new face's skin tone is adjusted to the scene, not the reference photo.\n \nOutput: one prompt (about 120 words) plus 4 negative terms.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the light in your video.\n2. Does the light change during the clip?\n3. What skin tone and age is the new face?\nBegin after your replies.",
