    "description": "Writes instructions so a swapped face keeps the original mouth shapes timed to the existing audio track.",
    "rawContent": "My video has speech already. I need a prompt that keeps the swapped face's lips in perfect sync with the audio.\n \nInstructions to write:\n1. Mouth shapes follow the original frame by frame (open, closed, rounded, wide).\n2. Teeth and tongue appear only when they appeared in the original.\n3. Jaw movement matches speech rhythm.\n4. No added smile or extra movement.\n \nContext: speaker is {{SPEAKER_DESCRIPTION}}, language is {{LANGUAGE}}.\n \nOutput: prompt under 110 words and a short checklist for reviewing sync.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Who is speaking and in which language?\n2. How fast do they talk?\n3. What tool will you use?\nBegin after my answers.",
