    "rawContent": "Context-Task-Constraint.\n \nContext: A new face was placed onto a person whose neck, ears, and hands are visible. Skin details: {{SKIN_DETAILS}}.\n \nTask: Write a prompt that makes face, neck, ears, and hands match in tone, texture, and warmth.\n \nConstraint: No smooth plastic look. Pores and fine lines must match the age {{AGE}}.\n \nOutput:\n1. Prompt under 120 words\n2. Negative prompt (no waxy skin, no visible seam, no color band at the jawline)\n3. One tip for checking the jawline edge\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the skin tone of the body and the new face.\n2. What age?\n3. Is there makeup or facial hair?\nBegin after I reply.",
