    "id": "7a550e94-ec44-5813-bc61-850151bbdd24",
    "title": "Before-After: Face Swap Quality Review Scorecard",
    "description": "Creates a scoring sheet to compare original and swapped clips on identity, expression, lighting, edges, and stability.",
    "rawContent": "Make a scorecard for reviewing my face replacement video.\n \nCategories, each scored 1 to 5:\n1. Identity match\n2. Expression and lip sync\n3. Lighting match\n4. Edge and hairline quality\n5. Stability over time\n6. Overall believability\n \nFor each category, describe what a 1, 3, and 5 looks like in one line.\n \nAdd a pass mark and 3 suggested next steps depending on the lowest score.\n \nOutput as a table.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the video about?\n2. What is the biggest concern?\nBegin after you receive my answers.",
