    "id": "aaf29ccf-d52d-52ce-85e9-9f5bfe7a2360",
    "title": "Pipeline Plan: End-to-End Face Replacement Workflow Builder",
    "description": "Builds a complete step-by-step workflow from raw footage to final export, with checkpoints for each stage of a face replacement project.",
    "rawContent": "Build a production pipeline for a face replacement video.\n \nStages to include:\n1. Source footage check (resolution, frame rate, lighting)\n2. Consent and reference preparation\n3. Test clip and settings\n4. Full run in chunks\n5. Cleanup (color, edges, audio)\n6. Review and disclosure labeling\n7. Export and backup\n \nFor each stage give: Goal, Tools or settings, Time estimate, Checkpoint question.\n \nTailor it to {{TOOL_STACK}}, {{VIDEO_LENGTH}}, and {{TEAM_SIZE}}.\n \nOutput as a table, then a one-paragraph risk summary.\n \nRemember: consent first, test clip before the full run.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Which tools do you have?\n2. How long is the video?\n3. Are you working alone or with a team?\nBegin after I answer.",
