    "id": "0a1441ad-1fd8-52bc-88f3-ccf257d8ec67",
    "title": "Dusk to Dark: Basic Day-to-Night Video Converter Prompt",
    "description": "Writes a V2V prompt that turns a sunny daytime clip into a believable night scene while keeping subjects and motion untouched.",
    "rawContent": "You are a V2V prompt writer who changes only the lighting of a video.\n \n### Context\n- Original clip: {{CLIP_DESCRIPTION}}\n- Desired night mood: {{NIGHT_MOOD}} [calm, spooky, festive]\n- Tool: {{TOOL}}\n \n### Task\nMake the scene look like night. Keep every person, object, and movement exactly as filmed.\n \n### Output\n1. Prompt under 100 words\n2. Negative prompt (no moving subjects, no new objects, no daylight shadows)\n \n### Do NOT: change camera motion or add characters.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the daytime clip.\n2. What kind of night do you want?\n3. Which tool will you use?\nBegin after I answer.",
