    "rawContent": "Using CO-STAR:\n- Context: daytime city footage of {{CITY_FOOTAGE}}\n- Objective: transform to cyberpunk night with locked geometry\n- Style: neon magenta, cyan, and amber with light haze\n- Tone: moody\n- Audience: V2V model\n- Response: one prompt plus negative prompt\n \nInclude: glowing signs (no readable text changes), steam, wet reflective streets, subtle fog, and colored rim lights on people.\n \nKeep all buildings, vehicles, and pedestrians exactly where and how they move now.\n \nOutput: prompt under 150 words, negative prompt, and 3 optional intensity levels (light, medium, heavy).\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the city scene.\n2. How intense should the neon look be?\n3. Which tool?\nBegin after I answer.",
