    "description": "Converts a daytime camp or outdoor scene to night lit by flames, with flickering warm light on faces and objects.",
    "rawContent": "Write a prompt that turns my daytime outdoor clip into a night scene lit mostly by a fire.\n \nFire details: {{FIRE_DETAILS}}.\n \nMake sure:\n1. Light is strongest near the fire and falls off quickly\n2. Faces facing the fire glow orange, the other side stays dark\n3. Flicker is gentle and irregular\n4. The background fades to deep blue and black\n5. Sparks rise slowly\n \nOutput: prompt under 120 words and a negative prompt.\n \nDo NOT: move people or change their positions.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Where is the fire in the scene?\n2. How many people and where do they sit?\n3. How big should the fire be?\nBegin after you answer.",
