    "description": "Creates a reusable night lighting style guide so multiple day-to-night clips in one project match in color, mood, and strength.",
    "rawContent": "Create a night lighting style guide for a project with {{CLIP_COUNT}} clips.\n \nThe guide must contain:\n1. A one-paragraph look description (mood, palette)\n2. Key light and fill light rules\n3. Sky and horizon rule\n4. Light source colors allowed (and not allowed)\n5. A reusable prompt prefix of 40 to 50 words to paste at the start of every clip\n6. A short per-clip checklist\n \nBase it on {{LOOK_REFERENCE}} and {{PROJECT_TYPE}}.\n \nOutput: the guide in clearly labeled sections.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the project and how many clips?\n2. What look or movie style do you want to match?\n3. Which tool?\nBegin after my answers.\nRow 59: Retro 1920s Film Restyle (V2V)\nCategory: Video Generation (T2V, I2V, V2V) | Prompts 1 to 20",
