    "title": "Period Props: Modern Object Replacement for Retro Restyles",
    "description": "Replaces phones, cars, signs, and screens with believable 1920s equivalents in a V2V restyle while keeping position and motion.",
    "rawContent": "Your job is to eliminate anachronisms.\n \nStep 1: Read the scene description {{SCENE_DESCRIPTION}}.\nStep 2: List every modern item (phones, LED lights, plastic bottles, modern cars, logos, screens).\nStep 3: For each, give a period-correct replacement that has the same size and position (telephone to candlestick phone, smartphone to pocket watch or small book).\nStep 4: Write the prompt with swap instructions and lock instructions for everything else.\n \nOutput: swap table (Modern item | Period item | Position note) and a prompt under 160 words.\n \nWarn me where a swap would change how a character moves, such as typing.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What objects or backgrounds are visible?\n2. Is any text or signage visible?\n3. How strict do you want historical accuracy to be?\nBegin after my answers.",
