    "description": "Adds gentle gate weave, slight handheld wobble, and uneven framing typical of old cameras without ruining the original composition.",
    "rawContent": "Write a prompt that adds light vintage camera instability.\n \nEffects to apply:\n- Gate weave: tiny vertical and horizontal jitter\n- Occasional slow drift in framing\n- Soft focus pulses\n- Slight, irregular zoom breathing\n \nStrength: {{SHAKE_STRENGTH}}.\n \nConstraints:\n1. The subject must never leave the frame.\n2. Motion stays small enough for the clip to remain watchable.\n \nOutput: prompt under 110 words, negative prompt (no motion sickness shaking, no new camera moves), and two strength variants.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Is the original camera steady or already moving?\n2. How strong should the effect feel?\nBegin after you answer.",
