    "id": "e0933d42-9cef-5465-8e46-d146d3415350",
    "title": "Fix Retro: Over-Stylized Restyle Troubleshooter",
    "description": "Diagnoses restyles that went too heavy, lost the subject, or still look modern, then rewrites the prompt to fix the balance.",
    "rawContent": "Look at my restyle problem and fix it.\n \nPrompt used: {{PROMPT_USED}}\nProblem: {{PROBLEM}} (for example \"too dark\", \"still looks digital\", \"faces melted\", \"color leaks through\")\n \nProcess:\n1. Diagnose the cause in one sentence.\n2. Identify which words in my prompt caused it.\n3. Offer a rewrite with a lighter, medium, and stronger version.\n4. Add one setting change in the tool, such as strength or guidance.\n \nOutput as 4 short sections.\n \nDo NOT: change the overall retro concept.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste the prompt you used.\n2. Describe what looks wrong.\n3. Which tool and strength setting?\nBegin after I answer.",
