    "description": "Restyles a modern party or dance scene into a 1920s dance hall look, with period clothing, lighting, and energetic motion kept intact.",
    "rawContent": "Plan a V2V restyle of a modern dance scene into a 1920s dance hall.\n \nStep 1: Read {{SCENE_DESCRIPTION}}.\nStep 2: Convert lighting to chandelier and lamp style, with soft glow and high-contrast black and white.\nStep 3: Convert outfits to 1920s styles (fringe dresses, suits, headbands).\nStep 4: Replace modern instruments and screens with period ones.\nStep 5: Lock every person's position and dance movement.\n \nOutput: conversion list, then a prompt under 170 words with a negative prompt (no changed choreography, no faces morphing in crowds).\n \nWarn me that crowd scenes are the most likely to break.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the dance scene and the crowd size.\n2. Which parts matter most to preserve?\n3. Which tool?\nBegin after I answer.",
