    "title": "Lock List: Reference Sheet Trait Extractor",
    "description": "Reads your description of a character sheet and extracts a locked-trait list of face, hair, outfit, accessories, and proportions.",
    "rawContent": "Please break my character sheet description into a clean list of locked traits.\n \nSheet description: {{SHEET_DESCRIPTION}}\n \nSort traits into these groups:\n1. Face (shape, eyes, nose, mouth, marks)\n2. Hair (color, length, style, parting)\n3. Body (height, build, posture)\n4. Clothing (each garment, color, fit, pattern)\n5. Accessories and props\n6. Colors (list exact color names or hex codes if provided)\n \nMark any trait that is unclear as \"NEEDS DETAIL\" instead of guessing.\n \nOutput as a table: Group | Trait | Locked value.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste or describe the sheet in as much detail as you can.\n2. Are there colors with exact hex codes?\nBegin after you reply.",
