    "description": "Writes expressions based on a reference emotion sheet so smiles, anger, and surprise look consistent with the character's established face.",
    "rawContent": "I have a reference sheet with several expressions of one character. Help me write prompts that use them accurately.\n \nExpressions on sheet: {{EXPRESSION_LIST}}\n \nFor each expression, describe:\n- Brow shape\n- Eye openness\n- Mouth shape\n- Cheek and chin tension\n- How long the expression holds in a clip\n \nThen write a 3-beat performance prompt moving from {{START_EMOTION}} to {{END_EMOTION}}.\n \nOutput: expression cards and the final prompt under 130 words.\n \nDo NOT: change the underlying face structure.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Which expressions are on the sheet?\n2. What emotional journey should happen in the clip?\nBegin after you reply.",
