    "rawContent": "Create a lock block library for my character.\n \nCharacter details: {{CHARACTER_DETAILS}}\n \nProduce 4 versions:\n1. Short (about 25 words) for tools with tight limits\n2. Medium (about 50 words)\n3. Long (about 100 words) with full detail\n4. Negative prompt block\n \nAlso produce 3 \"scene starter\" templates that use the medium block:\n- Dialogue scene\n- Action scene\n- Establishing shot\n \nMark every placeholder with {{CURLY_BRACES}}.\n \nOutput in labeled sections, ready to copy.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the character fully.\n2. Which video tools do you use and what are their prompt limits?\n3. What kinds of scenes do you shoot most?\nBegin after I respond.\nRow 61: Minimalist Logo Concept Generator\nCategory: Image Generation & Graphic Design | Prompts 1 to 20",
