    "id": "b3431285-395a-5bb5-a9c5-0afde5295e6f",
    "title": "Shape Language: Logo Symbol Concept Explorer",
    "description": "Generates 8 distinct symbol ideas for a logo from simple shapes, with the meaning behind each and an image prompt for the best three.",
    "rawContent": "Act as a creative director leading a logo brainstorm.\n \nBrand: {{BRAND_NAME}} | Industry: {{INDUSTRY}} | Core idea: {{CORE_IDEA}}\n \nSteps:\n1. Offer 8 symbol concepts built from only circles, triangles, squares, or lines.\n2. For each, write the hidden meaning in one sentence.\n3. Rank them by distinctiveness and scalability.\n4. Write image prompts for your top 3 (under 60 words each).\n \nOutput: numbered concept list, ranking, and 3 prompts.\n \nDo NOT: suggest concepts that resemble famous brand marks.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Brand name and industry?\n2. What single idea should the logo suggest [speed, trust, growth]?\n3. Any shapes or objects that must not appear?\nBegin after you answer.",
