    "title": "Negative Space: Hidden-Meaning Logo Prompt Designer",
    "description": "Designs clever negative-space logo concepts where a second image hides in the empty area, with a prompt for each idea.",
    "rawContent": "Your job is to invent negative-space logo concepts for {{BRAND_NAME}}.\n \n### Method\n1. Pick two ideas tied to the brand: {{IDEA_ONE}} and {{IDEA_TWO}}.\n2. Find a shared shape or silhouette that could carry both.\n3. Describe the positive shape and the negative shape separately.\n4. Check the concept: is the hidden image obvious within 3 seconds?\n5. Write an image prompt that explains the shapes and keeps it as simple black on white.\n \nProvide 3 concepts, each scored for clarity from 1 to 5.\n \nOutput: concept cards and prompts under 80 words each.\n \nNote: image AI struggles with true negative space, so expect to refine it in vector software.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the brand?\n2. What are two ideas or objects that relate to it?\n3. Should the logo be black and white or colored?\nBegin after I answer.",
