    "title": "Mascot Lite: Minimal Mascot Logo Concept Prompt",
    "description": "Designs a simplified, flat mascot logo with few shapes and bold color so it still works as a clean minimalist mark.",
    "rawContent": "Create a minimalist mascot logo prompt.\n \nAnimal or character: {{MASCOT_SUBJECT}}\nBrand personality: {{PERSONALITY}}\n \nSimplification rules:\n1. Use no more than 6 shapes\n2. Maximum 3 colors\n3. No gradients and no outlines thinner than 3 pixels at 200 pixel size\n4. Face has dots for eyes and one simple line for the mouth, if any\n \nOutput:\n- Prompt under 90 words\n- A shape breakdown list\n- A negative prompt\n \nAvoid copying any existing mascot.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What animal or character?\n2. What personality should it show?\n3. Which colors fit the brand?\nBegin after I answer.",
