    "rawContent": "Your job is to fix the \"AI plastic skin\" problem in portraits.\n \nSubject details: age {{AGE}}, skin tone {{SKIN_TONE}}, expression {{EXPRESSION}}.\n \nWrite three layers:\n1. Skin base: tone variations, undertone, redness near nose and cheeks\n2. Micro detail: pores, fine lines, peach fuzz, small blemishes, freckles if suitable\n3. Light interaction: specular highlights on forehead, nose, and cheekbones, soft shadow falloff\n \nOutput: a skin description paragraph (under 80 words), full portrait prompt (under 120 words), and a negative prompt (no airbrushed skin, no porcelain look, no waxy highlights).\n \nUse respectful, neutral descriptions for all skin tones.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Age and skin tone of the subject?\n2. Do you want natural imperfections or a lightly retouched look?\n3. What lighting is used?\nBegin after you answer.",
