    "id": "ac7dffac-1275-5d0a-95ea-4ab7b90c85bb",
    "title": "Retouch Level: Natural vs Heavy Retouch Prompt Variants",
    "description": "Writes the same portrait at four retouching levels, from raw natural to magazine glam, so you can pick the right polish.",
    "rawContent": "Create 4 prompt variants for one portrait with different retouching levels.\n \nBase portrait: {{BASE_PORTRAIT}}\n \nLevels:\n1. Raw natural: all skin detail visible\n2. Light retouch: small blemishes gone, texture kept\n3. Beauty retouch: smooth but still skin-like\n4. High-fashion polish: refined, glossy, stylized\n \nFor each level, give wording for skin, eyes, hair, and highlights.\n \nOutput: 4 prompts under 90 words each and a comparison note on when to use each.\n \nDo NOT: change the person's identity or features between levels.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Describe the base portrait.\n2. What will the image be used for?\nBegin after you respond.",
