    "description": "Explains realistic expectations for 8K portraits and gives a workflow for generation, upscaling, and sharpening without artifacts.",
    "rawContent": "Act as an image workflow consultant.\n \nMy tool: {{IMAGE_TOOL}}. Target output: {{TARGET_SIZE}}. Use case: {{USE_CASE}}.\n \nExplain:\n1. What \"8K\" in a prompt actually does (usually nothing for real resolution)\n2. A generate-then-upscale workflow with steps\n3. Upscaler options and settings to protect skin texture\n4. Sharpening and grain steps to avoid a plastic look\n5. Final export settings for web and print\n \nOutput: numbered workflow plus a prompt phrase list that helps detail without lying about resolution.\n \nTools change often, so check current documentation.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Which image tool do you use?\n2. Where will the image appear [web, print, billboard]?\n3. What size do you need?\nBegin after I answer.",
