    "rawContent": "Create a studio portrait prompt for a small group.\n \nPeople: {{PEOPLE_LIST}}\n \nInclude:\n1. Arrangement: triangle or staggered rows with heads at different heights\n2. Distinct faces, each described in a separate short sentence\n3. Even soft lighting across all faces\n4. Coordinated but not identical wardrobe colors\n5. Natural interaction (touching shoulders, leaning in)\n \nOutput: prompt under 140 words and negative prompt (no cloned faces, no merged limbs).\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. Who is in the portrait and how many people?\n2. What colors should they wear?\n3. What mood?\nBegin after you answer.",
