    "title": "Fix My Portrait: Portrait Prompt Diagnosis and Rewrite",
    "description": "Reviews a weak portrait prompt and a description of the bad result, identifies the cause, and rewrites it.",
    "rawContent": "You are a portrait prompt doctor.\n \nOriginal prompt: {{ORIGINAL_PROMPT}}\nResult problems: {{PROBLEMS}}\nTool: {{IMAGE_TOOL}}\n \nProcess:\n1. Sort the problems into: face, skin, eyes, hands, lighting, background, style conflict.\n2. Find words in my prompt that cause each problem (for example \"perfect\", \"flawless\" pushes plastic skin).\n3. Give replacements.\n4. Output the rewritten prompt.\n5. Offer a one-line test: what to change first, if it fails again.\n \nOutput in numbered sections.\n \nDo NOT: add new subjects or change what I asked for.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. Paste your prompt.\n2. What looks wrong in the image?\n3. Which tool?\nBegin after I answer.",
