    "description": "Plans a series of 6 to 12 portraits with consistent lighting, color, and style, including shot variety and a shared prompt prefix.",
    "rawContent": "Plan a cohesive portrait series.\n \nSubject or project: {{PROJECT_DESCRIPTION}}\nNumber of images: {{IMAGE_COUNT}}\n \nDeliver:\n1. A shared style prefix (lighting, color grade, lens, background rules) of 50 words\n2. A shot list with variety: close-up, half body, full body, profile, over the shoulder, candid\n3. A prompt for each shot using the prefix\n4. A consistency checklist\n5. An ordering suggestion for display\n \nKeep wording distinct for each shot while keeping the style identical.\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the project about?\n2. How many images?\n3. What look or mood ties the series together?\nBegin after I answer.\nRow 63: 3D Isometric Clay Icon\nCategory: Image Generation & Graphic Design | Prompts 1 to 20",
