    "title": "Soft Light: Clay Render Lighting and Shadow Prompt Writer",
    "description": "Specifies soft studio lighting, ambient occlusion, and contact shadows that give isometric clay objects depth.",
    "rawContent": "As a 3D lighting artist, write the lighting recipe for an isometric clay scene.\n \nScene: {{SCENE_DESCRIPTION}}\n \nDefine these elements:\n1. Key light: soft, from upper left, large source\n2. Fill light: ambient sky color\n3. Contact shadows: soft, slightly colored, under every object\n4. Ambient occlusion: darker creases where parts meet\n5. Background gradient and floor shadow shape\n \nOutput: a lighting paragraph (under 80 words), a complete prompt, and a negative prompt (no hard shadows, no multiple shadow directions).\n \nDo not start yet. Ask me:\n1. What is in the scene?\n2. What time of day or mood?\n3. Which background color?\nBegin after you reply.",
