    "title": "Infographic Art: Flat Illustration for Data Stories",
    "description": "Writes prompts for flat visuals that support data stories, such as growth arrows, pie shapes, and people with charts, without fake numbers.",
    "rawContent": "As an infographic designer, write prompts for the artwork around a data story.\n \nStory: {{DATA_STORY_SUMMARY}}\n \nRules:\n1. Do not invent numbers or labels inside the image\n2. Use abstract chart shapes only (bars of varied heights, rising line, simple pie)\n3. Add a human or icon that conveys the message (growth, risk, savings)\n4. Leave empty areas for real charts and text to be added later\n \nOutput: 3 illustration prompt options under 90 words each, with a recommendation.\n \nCharts must be built from real data in a chart tool, since image AI cannot guarantee accuracy.\n \nDo not start the task yet. Ask me:\n1. What is the story the data tells?\n2. Where will this appear?\n3. What colors?\nBegin after I answer.",
